    # mc "Perfecto. *Risa* Marca de rosa lo que se tenga que tirar."
    mc "Perfect. *Laugh* Put pink stickers on whatever needs to be thrown away."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:944
translate english c27s001_EmmVisit_adfb808d:

    # emm "¿Por qué? ¡Puedo marcar de rosa lo que se tenga que guardar!"
    emm "Why? I can put them on what needs to be kept!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:945
translate english c27s001_EmmVisit_ad3ec657:

    # mc "Entonces, si a algo se le cae la pegatina, lo tiraremos por error."
    mc "So, if something loses its sticker, we'll throw it away by mistake."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:947
translate english c27s001_EmmVisit_60c05042:

    # emm "¡Jobar! Tienes razón. Me jode que el rosa se asocie con algo que haya que tirar."
    emm "Damn! You're right. It pisses me off that pink is associated with something that should be thrown away."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:948
translate english c27s001_EmmVisit_a62ce474:

    # mc "*Risa* Todo el mundo lo asocia menos tú."
    mc "*Laugh* Everyone associates pink with garbage except for you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:952
translate english c27s001_EmmVisit_0fc72b29:

    # emm "No vas a conseguir ponerme de mal humor. ¡Voy a tener un estudio de fotografía en dos días!"
    emm "You're not going to put me in a bad mood. I'm getting a photography studio in two days!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:953
translate english c27s001_EmmVisit_5b48ef73:

    # mc "Tienes que dejar que la pintura se seque antes de montarlo todo, [emm]."
    mc "You have to let the paint dry before setting up the photography equipment, [emm]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:954
translate english c27s001_EmmVisit_ca53a091:

    # emm "Bueno, pues en tres días. Hasta luego, [mc]."
    emm "Well, in three days, then. See you later, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:955
translate english c27s001_EmmVisit_68457195:

    # mc "Hasta luego, [emm]."
    mc "See you later, [emm]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:959
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_72562f88:

    # "Mientras tanto, en el piso de los Washington..."
    "Meanwhile, at the Washingtons' apartment..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:960
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_6092ea65:

    # "*Ding-Dong*"
    "*Ding-Dong*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:961
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_96c22e11:

    # sam "Ya voy..."
    sam "*Through the door* I'm coming..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:963
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_72f19745:

    # ama "Buenos días, Sra. Washington. ¿Está la Srta. Washington en casa?"
    ama "Good afternoon, Mrs. Washington. Is Miss Washington available?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:965
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_b41bd84a:

    # sam "Hola, [ama]. Sí, [sim] está en casa, pasa."
    sam "Hello, [ama]. Yes, [sim] is home, come in."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:967
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_4782f10c:

    # ama "Puede llamarme Srta. Gilford..."
    ama "You can call me Miss Gilford..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:969
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_eefbf031:

    # sam "¿A qué vienen tantas formalidades? ¿Pasa algo?"
    sam "Why so formal? Is something wrong?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:971
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_cfcb1c2b:

    # ama "Hoy vengo en... misión de trabajo..."
    ama "Today I'm here on... a work assignment..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:972
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_5dd29f13:

    # ama "No sé cómo se hace esto. Creo que lo de los apellidos es más... no sé... oficial."
    ama "I don't know how to do this. I think using last names is more... I don't know... Official?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:974
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_c21bea45:

    # sam "*Risa* Si alguna vez tienes que venir al hospital, Dios no lo quiera, y me llamas Enfermera Washington, te pondré un enema de ortigas."
    sam "*Laugh* If you ever have to come to the hospital, God forbid, and you call me Nurse Washington, I'll put you on a nettle enema."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:975
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_5da0f725:

    # sam "Que sea oficial no quiere decir que nos tengamos que tratar como desconocidas. Siéntate, por favor."
    sam "Just because it's official doesn't mean we have to treat each other like strangers. Please, sit down."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:977
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_4951757e:

    # ama "¡Menos mal! Se me estaba haciendo rarísimo llamarte por tu apellido..."
    ama "Thank goodness! It was starting to feel really weird calling you by your last name..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:978
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_898664cf:

    # ama "¿Puedes avisar a [sim], por favor?"
    ama "Can you let [sim] know I'm here to see her, please?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:980
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_e4bf4017:

    # sim "¿Qué pasa [ama]? ¿Por qué estás tan elegante? ¿Vas a alguna parte?"
    sim "What's up [ama]? Why are you so dressed up? Are you going somewhere?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:981
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_22c68fe0:

    # sam "Viene en misión de trabajo. Creo que ese 'alguna parte' es aquí. Siéntate."
    sam "She's here on a business assignment. I think that 'somewhere' is here. Have a seat."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:983
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_dd943f91:

    # ama "Bueno, creo que esto se me da muy mal..."
    ama "Well, I think I'm really bad at this..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:984
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_81764b8f:

    # ama "Quería entregarte estos papeles, [sim]. Sólo tienes que firmarlos en la última hoja."
    ama "I wanted to give you these papers, [sim]. You just have to sign them on the last page."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:986
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_1cc80c8a:

    # sim "¿Qué es esto?"
    sim "What is this?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:988
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_7d2f2646:

    # sim "¿Qué? ¿Una beca? ¿Para la universidad?"
    sim "What? A scholarship? For college?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:989
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_9d20ceba:

    # sam "¿Qué? ¿Esto ha sido idea de [mc]? Ayer en el super le dije que no aceptábamos caridad."
    sam "What? Was this [mc]'s idea? Yesterday at the supermarket, I told him we don't accept charity."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:991
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_d17cab04:

    # ama "Bueno, [mc] firmó esos papeles hace unos días. No creo que vuestra conversación de ayer haya tenido nada que ver."
    ama "Well, [mc] signed those papers a few days ago. I don't think your conversation yesterday had anything to do with it."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:992
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_568d7891:

    # ama "Si lo firmas, puedo ir a la universidad a oficializar tu matrícula. Vamos un poco justos de tiempo."
    ama "If you sign it, I can go to the university to make your enrollment official. We're running a little short on time."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:994
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_5bb3075d:

    # sim "¡No puedo aceptar esto! No lo merezco y no vamos a aceptar caridad, como ha dicho mi madre."
    sim "I can't accept this! I don't deserve it, and we won't accept charity, as my mother said."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:996
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_81ba66f6:

    # ama "Yo no lo considero caridad. NTR ha creado una beca para la que eres la mejor candidata, con lo que no es como si [mc] estuviera pagando tu matriculación."
    ama "I don't consider it charity. NTR has created a scholarship for which you are the best candidate, so it's not as if [mc] is paying for your tuition."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:998
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_1a288648:

    # sim "¡Seguro que hay candidatas mejores! ¡Yo ya no puedo competir!"
    sim "I'm sure there are better candidates! I can't compete anymore!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1000
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_062caa19:

    # ama "En el tiempo que he tenido para evaluar a todas las candidatas no he encontrado a nadie mejor."
    ama "In the time I had to evaluate all the candidates, I didn't find anyone better than you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1001
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_d6f1a6f5:

    # ama "Y la beca es para que estudies Ciencias del Deporte, no para que nades. Para que te conviertas en entrenadora."
    ama "And the scholarship is for you to study Sports Science, not to swim. It's for you to become a swimming coach."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1003
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_0ec6aa72:

    # sam "¿Cuándo te encargó [mc] que hicieras esto, [ama]?"
    sam "When did [mc] ask you to do this, [ama]?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1005
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_44b66365:

    # ama "[mc] firmó los papeles el Sábado y..."
    ama "[mc] signed the papers on Saturday and..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1007
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_0fb2f8cd:

    # sam "No te he preguntado cuándo lo firmó. Te estoy preguntando cuándo te encargó que estudiaras la creación de la beca."
    sam "I didn't ask you when he signed them. I'm asking you when he commissioned you to look into setting up the scholarship."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1008
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_768dcbc5:

    # sam "Porque te lo encargó él, ¿no? ¿O ha sido idea tuya? ¿O de alguien más?"
    sam "Because he asked you to, right? Or was it your idea? Or someone else's?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1010
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_57dbe55f:

    # ama "Bueno... Como CEO de NTR, me lo encargó él en cuanto firmó los papeles y..."
    ama "Well... As NTR's CEO, he entrusted me with it as soon as he signed the papers and..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1012
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_06fc8dc9:

    # sim "Pero esos papeles... ¿los redactó él o se los entregaste tú? ¿O se los entregó alguna otra persona?"
    sim "But those papers... did he write them himself, or did you give them to him? Or did someone else give them to him?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1014
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_884f0e9f:

    # ama "¿Qué más da quién redactara los requisitos de la beca? Lo importante es que lo firmes."
    ama "What does it matter who wrote the scholarship requirements? The important thing is for you to sign it."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1016
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_6c1250ef:

    # sam "Está claro que no fue idea de [mc]. Si lo fuera, ella lo habría dicho sin dar tantos rodeos."
    sam "It's clear that it wasn't [mc]'s idea. If it had been, she would have said so without beating around the bush."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1017
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_7c9c4d16:

    # sam "Apostaría algo a que 'alguien' escuchó tu conversación con [deb.nick] y [mc] sobre entrenar y sobre que hubieras querido estudiar educación deportiva."
    sam "I would wager that 'someone' overheard your conversation with [deb.nick] and [mc] about training and how you wanted to study Sports Science."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1019
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_d36f86f0:

    # sim "Tienes razón. Allí sólo estábamos [deb.nick], [mc], y yo. [deb.nick], pese a que tiene el dinero para hacerlo, no haría una beca a nombre de NTR."
    sim "You're right. It was just [deb.nick], [mc], and me there. [deb.nick], even though she has the money to do so, would not set up a scholarship in NTR's name."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1020
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_b587d91b:

    # sim "Y [mc], como acabas de decir, está claro que no lo ha hecho."
    sim "And it's clear that [mc] didn't do it, as you just said."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1022
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_a1c41572:

    # sim "¿O de [eva]?" (multiple=2)
    sim "Or [eva]'s?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1023
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_476bab9b:

    # sam "¿Ha sido idea tuya?" (multiple=2)
    sam "Was it your idea?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1025
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_8b47d22e:

    # sam "Si hubiera sido de [eva], sería ella la que estuviera aquí."
    sam "If it had been [eva]'s, she would be the one here."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1026
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_a796d1ba:

    # sim "Tienes razón. Además, [eva] no tendría tantos reparos en aceptar que la idea ha sido suya."
    sim "You're right. Besides, [eva] wouldn't have any qualms about accepting that the idea was hers."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1027
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_1a69b8d9:

    # sam "Ni en aceptar el agradecimiento por haber tenido la idea."
    sam "Not to mention accepting our gratitude for having come up with the idea."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1029
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_e6babcf2:

    # ama "¿Agradecimiento? ¿No estáis enfadadas porque le presentara los papeles a [mc]?"
    ama "Gratitude? Aren't you mad that I submitted the scholarship papers to [mc]?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1031
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_1fb92d4a:

    # sim "¡Has caído en la trampa!" (multiple=2)
    sim "You fell into the trap!" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1032
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_25c95a6b:

    # sam "¡Lo sabía!" (multiple=2)
    sam "I knew it!" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1034
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_db7734ff:

    # sim "¡Se nota que no te has criado con mi madre! Ni Jamaal ni yo caemos en esas trampas desde hace años."
    sim "It's obvious you didn't grow up with my mother! Neither Jamaal nor I have fallen for those tricks in years."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1035
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_9cfb1054:

    # sim "Pero ahora entiendo por qué a mi madre le gustaba tanto tendérnoslas."
    sim "But now I understand why my mother liked to lay them out for us so much."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1037
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_a5a08d73:

    # ama "Entonces... ¿vas a firmar los papeles ahora que sabéis que no es cosa de [mc], [sim]?"
    ama "So... are you going to sign the papers now that you know it's not [mc]'s fault, [sim]?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1039
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_a066af1d:

    # sim "¡No! ¡No lo puedo aceptar!" (multiple=2)
    sim "No! I can't accept it!" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1040
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_83a2f811:

    # sam "¡Ya te hemos dicho que no aceptamos caridad!" (multiple=2)
    sam "We already told you we don't accept charity!" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1042
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_8f2353c6:

    # jam "¿Quieres firmar los putos papeles de una vez, [sim]?"
    jam "Will you sign the fucking papers once and for all, [sim]?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1043
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_1a5db2cb:

    # jam "Y ya sé que tengo que poner un dólar en el bote de los tacos, pero es el dólar que menos me va a doler poner en mi vida."
    jam "And I know I have to put a dollar in the swear jar, but it's the least painful dollar I'll ever spend in my life."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1045
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_9500304c:

    # jam "[ama] se ha molestado en crear una beca para ti y te pones... os ponéis las dos... hechas una furia."
    jam "[ama] has gone to the trouble of setting up a scholarship for you, and you... both of you... are getting all worked up."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1046
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_9be860db:

    # jam "Una cosa es no aceptar caridad, y otra distinta es no aceptar favores."
    jam "It is one thing not to accept charity, and quite another not to accept favors."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1048
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_bdae2aa2:

    # jam "Por cierto, hola, [ama]. Perdona a las irracionales Washington. Yo soy la parte que piensa. Esa beca, ¿te cuesta dinero a ti?"
    jam "By the way, hello, [ama]. Forgive the irrational Washingtons. I'm the thinking part of this household. That scholarship, does it cost you any money?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1050
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_037995c1:

    # ama "Hola, Jamaal. No, es dinero de NTR... Y tiene retorno de impuestos."
    ama "Hi, Jamaal. No, it's NTR money... And it's tax deductible."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1052
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_79fd1ecd:

    # jam "¿Veis? ¡No es una maldita obra de caridad! Sí, otro dólar. Es una empresa haciendo algo que le beneficia a largo plazo."
    jam "See? It's not a damn charity! Yes, another dollar. It's a company doing something that benefits it in the long run."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1053
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_5f37ebc4:

    # jam "¿La estaríais rechazando si fuese MocoSoft o FAPple en vez de NTR? Seguro que no pero, como es la empresa de [mc], hay que poner pegas, ¿no?"
    jam "Would you be rejecting it if it came from MocusSoft or FAPple instead of NTR? Surely not, but since it's [mc]'s company, you have to find fault with it, right?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1054
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_7a2b6df3:

    # jam "¡Ni siquiera le habéis dado las gracias a [ama]!"
    jam "You haven't even thanked [ama]!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1056
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_91f72a49:

    # sam "Tiene un poco de razón, ¿no? ¿Estamos siendo un poco irracionales?"
    sam "There's some truth in that, isn't there? Are we being a little irrational?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1057
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_d5fa0ea9:

    # sim "Es posible. ¡Mielda, no me gusta darle la razón a Jamaal!"
    sim "It's possible. Sheep, I don't like admitting Jamaal is right!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1059
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_ea91ad77:

    # jam "Entonces todo arreglado. Vuelvo a mi habitación. He dejado a medias el chat con un cliente."
    jam "Then everything's sorted. I'll go back to my room. I left a chat with a customer half-finished."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1061
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_3949f53b:

    # sim "Toma, aquí están los papeles firmados. Y gracias."
    sim "Here, take the signed papers. And thank you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1062
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_fb9896bb:

    # sim "Pero, ¿cómo lo sabías? Nunca hemos hablado de ello..."
    sim "But how did you know? We've never talked about it..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1064
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_56ba5122:

    # ama "El otro día, cuando estabas en la piscina con [mc] y [deb.nick]..."
    ama "The other day, when you were at the pool with [mc] and [deb.nick]..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1066
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_c5c40574:

    # "Después de dar las explicaciones de cómo surgió el plan de la beca..."
    "After explaining how the scholarship plan came about..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1067
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_c1b46714:

    # sim "Gracias, [ama]. No sé si hubiera podido estudiar sin lo que acabas de hacer."
    sim "Thank you, [ama]. I don't know if I could have studied without what you just did."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1068
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_0d63803d:

    # ama "No es sólo mérito mío. [mc] estuvo de acuerdo con la idea y fue quien dio la orden ejecutiva."
    ama "It's not just my doing. [mc] agreed with the idea and gave the executive order."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1069
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_1a37f0cd:

    # sim "Seguramente no lo hubiera hecho si no hubiera sido por ti. Sabe cómo nos sentimos cuando se nos ofrece... caridad."
    sim "He probably wouldn't have done it if it hadn't been for you. He knows how we feel when we're offered... charity."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1070
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_bc5bac69:

    # ama "Yo también lo sé, pero esto no es caridad. Son negocios. Y un favor a una hermana."
    ama "I know that too, but this isn't charity. It's business. And a favor to a sister."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1072
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_12319058:

    # sam "Disculpa por cómo nos hemos comportado. Lo de ser irracional lo llevamos en la sangre."
    sam "Sorry for how we behaved. Being irrational is in our blood."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1073
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_f2fb2f00:

    # ama "No hay nada por lo que disculparse."
    ama "There's nothing to apologize for."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1074
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_a63e40e4:

    # sam "¿Has comido ya? ¿Quieres quedarte a comer?"
    sam "Have you had lunch yet? Would you like to stay and have lunch with us?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1075
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_13f2237f:

    # ama "Me encantaría."
    ama "I'd love to."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1076
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_3e16133e:

    # sam "He hecho pierogi para nosotros tres, podemos dividirlos y hacer una ensalada más grande."
    sam "I've made pierogis for the three of us. We can split them up and make a bigger salad."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1077
translate english c27s002_AmaSimSamJam_42714c23:

    # jam "*Desde su habitación* ¡Nooooooo!"
    jam "*From his room* Nooooooo!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1085
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_05f06837:

    # "Un par de minutos después de que [emm] se vaya..."
    "A couple of minutes after [emm] leaves..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1087
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_f51bd432:

    # "Nada más entrar en tu habitación después de comer..."
    "As soon as you enter your room after lunch..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1088
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_7dda0259:

    # "*Ring-Ring*"
    "*Ring-Ring*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1089
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_307848b4:

    # mcp "(¿Videoconferencia con Aaron? No teníamos nada programado para hoy...)"
    mcp "(A video conference with Aaron? We didn't have anything scheduled for today...)"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1091
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_12e8a860:

    # mc "Hola, Aaron. ¿Puedo ayudarte en algo?"
    mc "Hello, Aaron. Can I help you with anything?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1092
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_b015eb34:

    # aar "Bueno, llamaba para un par de cosas. La primera es que quiero asegurarme de que habéis recibido el dinero."
    aar "Well, I was calling about a couple of things. The first is that I want to make sure you received the money."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1093
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_66a28bc0:

    # mc "Sí, fue una sorpresa. Lo esperábamos hacia final de año."
    mc "Yes, it was a surprise. We were expecting it towards the end of the year."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1095
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_eb8b7b59:

    # aar "Bueno, sobre eso... He descubierto que Daniels maquillaba los libros de contabilidad. [mar] y [nor] sólo estaban recibiendo la mitad de lo que les pertocaba."
    aar "Well, about that... I found out that Daniels was cooking the accounting books. [mar] and [nor] were only getting half of what they were owed."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1096
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_f59c8bb0:

    # aar "Una de las transferencias era desviada como gastos. Se quedaba una parte. Richards lo hacía antes que él, con lo que..."
    aar "One of the transfers was diverted as expenses. A portion was retained. Richards did the same before him, so..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1097
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_758f2346:

    # mc "Le debemos un montón de dinero a [mar] y a [nor]. 20 años a $83,000... alrededor de $1,600,000."
    mc "We owe [mar] and [nor] a lot of money. 20 years at $83,000... around $1,600,000."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1099
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_71b1055b:

    # aar "Bastante menos. Los primeros años era muy poco dinero, y después fue creciendo. Pero sí, NTR les debe algo menos de $900,000 a cada una."
    aar "Quite a bit less. In the early years, it was very little money, and then it grew. But yes, NTR owes them a little less than $900,000 each."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1100
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_bbfdd42e:

    # aar "Es algo que tendremos que solucionar, pero habrá tiempo para eso cuando estés aquí."
    aar "It's something we'll have to sort out, but there'll be time for that when you're here."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1102
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_79decbe0:

    # aar "¿Cómo ves tu sueldo de CEO? Creo que no habíamos hablado de ello en ningún momento."
    aar "How do you feel about your CEO salary? I don't think we've discussed it at all."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1103
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_83eaadaa:

    # mc "Me sorprendió la cantidad. No esperaba tanto."
    mc "I was surprised by the amount. I wasn't expecting so much."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1104
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_a26866a8:

    # aar "Era lo que cobraba Daniels, con lo que es difícil de justificar bajar tu sueldo."
    aar "That's what Daniels was getting paid, so it's hard to justify lowering your salary."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1106
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_a6df5df9:

    # aar "Sobre el tema de los sueldos... tengo que pedirte una cosa..."
    aar "On the subject of salaries... I have to ask you a favor..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1107
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_e42e4e08:

    # mc "Dime. Lo que necesites. Supongo que ahora que tienes el cargo de Director de Operaciones, te habrás subido el sueldo, ¿no?"
    mc "Tell me. Whatever you need. I guess now that you're Director of Operations, you raised your salary, right?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1109
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_9aa7c0c5:

    # aar "Bueno, no es que me haya subido el sueldo. He cobrado un sueldo por primera vez en mi vida."
    aar "Well, it's not that I got a raise. I got paid for the first time in my life."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1110
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_4de36aed:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿No cobrabas? ¿Las chicas tampoco?"
    mc "What? You never got paid? The girls didn't either?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1112
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_1b997de3:

    # aar "No. Ninguno de los operativos cobrábamos. Nuestro 'pago' era vivir en la base, alimentación, entrenamiento..."
    aar "No. None of the operatives were paid. Our 'payment' was living at the base, food, training..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1113
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_a8247bb1:

    # aar "Tampoco es que hubiéramos tenido dónde gastarlos. Imagínate 16 clones de la Serie G entrando a la vez en un bar de Oranjestaad."
    aar "It's not like we had anywhere to spend it. Imagine 16 clones from the G Series walking into a bar in Oranjestad at the same time."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1114
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_d56b9c53:

    # mc "Lo entiendo."
    mc "I understand."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1116
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_9493f119:

    # aar "Por eso quiero pedirte el favor del que te hablaba. Las chicas nunca han tenido dinero propio. Ahora tienen más de $40,000 cada una."
    aar "That's why I want to ask you for the favor I mentioned. The girls have never had any money of their own. Now they have over $50,000 each."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1117
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_6f6582e4:

    # aar "Dudo que [ama] vaya a hacer alguna locura, pero... si pudieras vigilar un poco a [eva], me harías... nos harías un favor a todos."
    aar "I doubt [ama] will do anything crazy, but... if you could keep an eye on [eva], you'd be doing me... all of us a favor."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1118
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_43923d2e:

    # mc "Ningún problema. Creo que puedo convencer a [mar] y a [nor] para que les den una charla sobre el dinero."
    mc "No problem. I think I can convince [mar] and [nor] to give them a talk about money."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1119
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_cc7d56b7:

    # mc "Les dará la oportunidad de pasar más tiempo con ellas a solas y ejercer de madres."
    mc "It will give them the opportunity to spend more time alone with them and act as mothers."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1121
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_4d156b23:

    # aar "Perfecto. Entonces, creo que ahora viene el tema más complicado."
    aar "Perfect. So, I think now comes the most complicated part."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1123
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_98fd59ca:

    # aar "Necesitaría hablar con [bet.full]."
    aar "I would need to speak with [bet.full]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1124
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_6e0c7c96:

    # mc "¿Con Tía [bet]? ¿Para qué?"
    mc "With Aunt [bet]? What for?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1125
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_b3f8879e:

    # aar "Es por un tema médico que..."
    aar "It's due to a medical issue that..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1126
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_9683bb47:

    # mc "¿Te pasa algo? ¿Estás bien?"
    mc "Is something wrong? Are you okay?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1128
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_254f7d09:

    # aar "No, tranquilo, no es para mí. Hemos perdido al cirujano que teníamos en NTR y..."
    aar "No, don't worry, it's not for me. We lost the neurosurgeon we had at NTR and..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1130
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1131
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_2d7ccd4e:

    # mar "*A través de la puerta* Soy yo. ¿Puedo pasar?"
    mar "*Through the door* It's me. Can I come in?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1132
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_2422e723:

    # mc "Sí, pasa. Estoy en una videoconferencia con Aaron."
    mc "Yes, come in. I'm in a video conference with Aaron."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1134
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_c61f7c69:

    # mar "¿Hola, Aaron? ¿Qué tal todo por Aruba?"
    mar "Hi, Aaron! How is everything in Aruba?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1136
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_d7bc2045:

    # aar "Todo bien, [mar]. Estaba discutiendo unos temas con [mc]."
    aar "Everything's fine, [mar]. I was discussing some issues with [mc]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1138
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_86e106ad:

    # mar "Entonces os dejo con vuestros asuntos. Lo que venía a decirle a..."
    mar "Then I'll leave you to your business. What I came to say to..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1140
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_9bb25db6:

    # mar "... [mc]..."
    mar "... [mc]..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1141
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_3f55ac25:

    # mar "... no es..."
    mar "... isn't..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1142
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_08ad065f:

    # mar "... urgente..."
    mar "... urgent..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1143
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_316010b6:

    # mc "¿Puedes decirle a Tía [bet] que venga, por favor? Aaron quiere hablar con ella."
    mc "Can you tell Aunt [bet] to come here, please? Aaron wants to talk to her."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1145
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_dd74f574:

    # mar "Sí... Ahora voy... a avisarla... Está en la piscina..."
    mar "Yes... I'll go tell her... She's by the pool..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1147
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_eaef52fa:

    # mc "Gracias, Mamá."
    mc "Thank you, Mom."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1149
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_73d262ed:

    # mc "Gracias, [mar]."
    mc "Thank you, [mar]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1151
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_c8e89903:

    # mc "Si quieres esperamos que llegue Tía [bet] para seguir hablando de lo que necesitas de ella."
    mc "If you want, we can wait for Aunt [bet] to arrive so you can continue talking to her about what you need."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1152
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_bd5d5f95:

    # mc "Mientras tanto voy pasando la video conferencia al portátil. Será más cómodo."
    mc "In the meantime, I'll transfer the video conference to my laptop. It'll be more comfortable."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1153
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_e7c51356:

    # mc "¿Qué ha pasado con el cirujano?"
    mc "What happened to the surgeon?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1154
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_1b5a9b9a:

    # aar "El cirujano principal era Daniels."
    aar "The lead surgeon was Daniels."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1155
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_7f59aec1:

    # mc "Y supongo que ahora no puede trabajar con nosotros, ¿no?"
    mc "And I guess he can't work with us now, can he?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1157
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_a92cc8e6:

    # aar "Es complicado... Aún tenemos que decidir qué vamos a hacer con él. Pero no me fiaría de que me operara, si fuera necesario."
    aar "It's complicated... We still have to decide what to do with him. But I wouldn't trust him to operate on me, if necessary."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1158
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_d323c6bf:

    # aar "Y sus ayudantes dan el nivel para operaciones más básicas. No para lo que necesitamos ahora mismo."
    aar "And his assistants are only qualified for more basic surgeries. Not for what we need right now."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1159
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_95da287a:

    # mc "Sobre Daniels, ¿qué opciones tenemos?"
    mc "Regarding Daniels, what options do we have?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1161
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_6de03863:

    # aar "Como te digo, es complicado. No lo podemos entregar a la justicia de Aruba."
    aar "As I said, it's complicated. We can't hand him over to the Aruban authorities."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1162
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_31a5810a:

    # aar "Ha ordenado asesinatos, pero todo saldría a la luz en un juicio público y eso es lo que menos nos conviene."
    aar "He has ordered assassinations, but everything would come to light in a public trial, and that is the last thing we want."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1163
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_7539a30f:

    # mc "Lo entiendo. Nos tocará a nosotros impartir justicia, entonces."
    mc "I understand. It will be up to us to dispense justice, then."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1165
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_0d52c23f:

    # aar "Justicia. Aunque no sea legal. Quiero consultarlo con las chicas cuando estén aquí. No es algo para tratar en una video conferencia."
    aar "Justice. Even if it's not legal. I want to discuss it with the girls when they get here. It's not something to be discussed over a video conference."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1166
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_461bdae7:

    # aar "De hecho, tenerlo 'prisionero' ya es ilegal. No tenemos ningún derecho legal a hacerlo, pero las autoridades de Aruba van a mirar hacia otro lado."
    aar "In fact, holding him 'prisoner' is already illegal. We have no legal right to do so, but the Aruban authorities are going to look the other way."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1167
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_e867c270:

    # mc "Supongo que tan ilegal como asesinarlo..."
    mc "I guess it's as illegal as murdering him..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1169
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_62464051:

    # aar "Por eso lo quiero consultar con las chicas. Si por mi fuera, le dispararía en la cabeza ahora mismo, pero ellas también tienen derecho a decidir qué hacer con él."
    aar "That's why I want to talk it over with the girls. If it were up to me, I'd shoot him in the head right now, but they also have a right to decide what to do with him."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1170
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_1aa76c3f:

    # aar "Sus hermanas murieron por culpa de Daniels, igual que mi hermano. Tienen el mismo derecho a decidir que yo."
    aar "Their sisters died because of Daniels, just like my brother. They have the same right to decide as I do."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1180
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_7d323a19:

    # mc "Creo que también deberíamos tener derecho a decidir, aunque gracias a vosotros no perdiéramos a nadie."
    mc "I think we should also have the right to decide, even though thanks to you we didn't lose anyone."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1182
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_f90ff87a:

    # aar "Esperaba que dijeras algo así y lo considero lógico."
    aar "I expected you to say something like that, and I think it's logical."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1183
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_d50e5700:

    # aar "Pienso que, cuando estéis los tres aquí, habrá que decidir."
    aar "I think that when the three of you are here, we'll have to decide."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1186
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_2d094ad0:

    # mc "Creo que es un tema que deberíais decidir vosotros, gracias a vosotros nosotros no perdimos a nadie, y no creo que debamos intervenir en esa situación."
    mc "I think it's something you should decide. Thanks to you, we didn't lose anyone, and I don't think we should get involved in that situation."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1188
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_aab08895:

    # aar "No esperaba que dijeras algo así... Creía que ibas a querer participar en la decisión, aunque te agradezco que lo dejes en nuestras manos."
    aar "I didn't expect you to say that... I thought you would want to be involved in the decision, but I appreciate you leaving it up to us."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1189
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_4f6ee7d1:

    # aar "Pienso que, cuando estén las dos aquí, habrá que decidir."
    aar "I think that when they're both here, we'll have to decide."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1191
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_34d3bc90:

    # mc "Me parece que no van a coincidir las dos allí. [eva] no está preparada para ver a Gavin todavía, con lo que se quedará aquí el primer mes."
    mc "I don't think the two of them will be there at the same time. [eva] isn't ready to see Gavin yet, so she'll stay here for the first month."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1192
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_7322ce6c:

    # mc "Después rotarán. [ama] volverá a casa y [eva] estará allí conmigo."
    mc "Then they will rotate. [ama] will return home and [eva] will be there with me."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1194
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_04ee3015:

    # aar "Entonces, durante la rotación. Habrá que hacer que coincidan las dos aquí para tomar esa decisión."
    aar "Then, during the rotation, you'll have to make the two coincide here to make that choice."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1195
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_f5687c30:

    # mc "Por cierto, ¿cómo está Gavin?"
    mc "By the way, how is Gavin?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1196
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_cf05b26f:

    # aar "De eso es de lo que quiero hablar con [bet.full]."
    aar "That's what I want to talk to [bet.full] about."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1197
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_4932b211:

    # mc "Oigo pasos en la escalera. Debe ser ella."
    mc "I hear footsteps on the stairs. It must be her."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1199
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_dd0461ef_1:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1200
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_76ad3c97:

    # bet "*A través de la puerta* Soy yo. [mar] me ha dicho que querías verme."
    bet "*Through the door* It's me. [mar] told me you wanted to see me."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1201
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_3e917570:

    # mc "Sí, pasa, Tía [bet]."
    mc "Yes, come in, Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1203
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_ffd92977:

    # mc "Siéntate. Aaron quiere hablar contigo. Os presento."
    mc "Sit down. Aaron wants to talk to you. Let me introduce you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1204
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_b705c9da:

    # bet "Encantada de conocerte, Aaron."
    bet "Nice to meet you, Aaron."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1206
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_f2636f38:

    # aar "Lo mismo digo, Sra. [bet.full]."
    aar "Likewise, Miss [bet.full]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1208
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_82ed1e9d:

    # bet "..."
    bet "..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1209
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_88aef742:

    # mc "¿Qué pasa Tía [bet]?"
    mc "What's up, Aunt [bet]?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1211
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_7f1d29ac:

    # bet "Nadie me había dicho que Aaron era un clon tuyo."
    bet "No one told me Aaron was a clone of you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1212
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_221ba789:

    # mc "¡Mierda, Tía [bet]! No se te puede ocultar nada. No se lo hemos dicho a nadie todavía."
    mc "Damn, Aunt [bet]! We can't hide anything from you. We haven't told anyone else yet."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1213
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_27a325bb:

    # bet "Veros a la vez lo hace obvio. Seguramente no lo hubiera notado si os viera por separado. Como mucho hubiera pensado que tenéis un cierto parecido."
    bet "Seeing you both together makes it obvious. I probably wouldn't have noticed if I had seen you separately. At most, I would have thought that you looked somewhat alike."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1214
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_0b02bf49:

    # mc "Ni Mamá ni Tía [nor] lo notaron durante la reunión que tuvimos con él..."
    mc "Neither Mom nor Aunt [nor] noticed it during the meeting we had with him..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1216
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_a01aaafe:

    # bet "*Risa* Supongo que sólo tenían ojos para [ama] y [eva]."
    bet "*Laugh* I guess they only had eyes for [ama] and [eva]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1217
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_ab8af0b0:

    # bet "Además, la diferencia de edad aparente hace que el cerebro no os relacione. Nuestro cerebro no está preparado para procesar algo así."
    bet "Furthermore, the apparent age difference prevents the brain from making the connection. Our brains are not equipped to process something like that."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1218
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_697acc41:

    # mc "Excepto el tuyo, por lo que parece..."
    mc "Except for yours, it seems..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1220
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_9a01a595:

    # aar "Le agradecería que no les dijera nada al resto de su familia, ni a [ama] y a [eva]."
    aar "I would appreciate it if you didn't say anything to the rest of your family, or to [ama] and [eva]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1221
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_c806bbff:

    # aar "No quiero que se sientan obligados a considerarme parte de la familia sólo porque compartamos genes."
    aar "I don't want you to feel obligated to consider me part of the family just because we share genes."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1222
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_17ef67ef:

    # aar "Y se lo quiero decir a mis chicas en persona."
    aar "And I want to tell my girls in person."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1224
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_f39fbdc6:

    # bet "Lo entiendo, aunque no lo comparta. Pero voy a ponerte una condición, Aaron. Deja de llamarme Sra. [bet.full] y llámame [bet]."
    bet "I understand, even though I don't agree. But I'm going to give you one condition, Aaron. Stop calling me Miss [bet.full] and call me [bet]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1225
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_21b8e252:

    # bet "*Risa* No eres mi sobrino, pero eres el clon de [mc] y me siento rara viendo a su cara llamándome así."
    bet "*Laugh* You're not my nephew, but you're [mc]'s clone, and I feel weird seeing his face calling me that."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1227
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_ca2214ee:

    # aar "Me parece una condición que puedo cumplir. Mientras no me obligue a llamarla Tía [bet]..."
    aar "I think that's a condition I can meet. As long as you don't make me call you Aunt [bet]..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1228
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_9f143587:

    # aar "Pero no quiero entretenerla más de lo necesario, con lo que, si no le importa, voy a ir al grano."
    aar "But I don't want to keep you any longer than necessary, so, if you don't mind, I'll get straight to the point."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1229
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_a39c3339:

    # aar "No sé si se acuerda de Gavin..."
    aar "I am not sure if you recall Gavin..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1231
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_e17e8f7f:

    # bet "Sí, el chico que perdió el brazo por lo que pasó en nuestra cocina. ¿Qué le pasa?"
    bet "Yes, the guy who lost his arm because of what happened in our kitchen. What's wrong with him?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1233
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_0ac571ae:

    # aar "Necesita una operación, y no tenemos un neurocirujano disponible. Creo que usted podría ser una buena opción."
    aar "He needs surgery, and we don't have a neurosurgeon available. I think you might be a good option."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1234
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_44514949:

    # aar "Como además... no es demasiado legal en los Estados Unidos... debería hacerse aquí."
    aar "Also, since it's not a legal procedure in the United States, it should be done here."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1236
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_301f5ad1:

    # bet "¿De qué tipo de operación estamos hablando, Aaron? ¿Por qué no es legal aquí?"
    bet "What kind of surgery are we talking about, Aaron? Why isn't it legal here?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1238
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_7ec91e4c:

    # "Aaron pasa alrededor de 10 minutos explicando la operación a un nivel que incluso tú puedes entender."
    "Aaron spends about 10 minutes explaining the procedure at a level that even you can understand."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1239
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_e06644f0:

    # "Lo entiendes tan bien que, cuando acaba con la explicación, tienes la boca abierta por la sorpresa."
    "You understand it so well that, when he finishes his explanation, you find yourself with your mouth open in surprise."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1240
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_47d34dd9:

    # mcp "(¡Oh, Dios mío! ¡Eso es pura ciencia ficción!)"
    mcp "(Oh my gosh! That's pure science fiction!)"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1242
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_59639f94:

    # bet "Parece una operación complicada y no sé si tengo los conocimientos para hacerla. No creo que NADIE tenga los conocimientos para hacerla."
    bet "It seems like a complicated operation, and I don't know if I have the knowledge to do it. I don't think ANYONE has the knowledge to do it."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1243
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_792505a9:

    # bet "Mándame toda la documentación de la que has hablado y lo estudiaré. ¿Cuándo se debería hacer?"
    bet "Send me all the documentation you mentioned, and I will look into it. When should it be done?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1245
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_90efe756:

    # aar "Por lo que me han dicho los cirujanos que tenemos aquí, cuanto antes mejor."
    aar "From what the surgeons here told me, the sooner the better."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1246
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_f2ecd04f:

    # aar "Lo ideal sería que, si decide hacerlo, acompañe a [mc] a Aruba cuando él venga."
    aar "Ideally, if you decide to do so, you should accompany [mc] to Aruba when he comes here."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1247
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_55699a5f:

    # aar "Una vez esté aquí, tendrá tiempo de comentar todo el proceso junto con el equipo."
    aar "Once you are here, you will have time to discuss the entire process with the team that will assist you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1249
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_25fba1cb:

    # bet "Suena a un buen plan. Aún quedan unos días para que [mc] vaya y tendré tiempo de estudiar la documentación y confirmarte si me veo preparada para hacer esa operación."
    bet "Sounds like a good plan. There are still a few days left before [mc] leaves, so I'll have time to study the documentation and let you know if I feel ready to do that surgery."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1250
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_d6328777:

    # bet "Si decidimos hacerlo, quiero tener el control absoluto en el proceso."
    bet "If we decide to do it, I want to have complete control over the process."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1251
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_c22ae55b:

    # bet "No quiero algo a medias tintas que pueda poner en peligro la vida del chico."
    bet "I don't want a half-hearted solution that could endanger the boy's life."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1253
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_90466345:

    # aar "Me parece bien. Voy a pedirle al equipo que le mande toda la documentación lo antes posible."
    aar "Sounds good to me. I'll ask the team to send you all the documentation as soon as possible."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1254
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_b0dea3e0:

    # aar "Y ahora les tengo que dejar. Debo entrar en otra reunión."
    aar "And now I must leave you. I have another meeting to attend."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1255
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_afd0d15c:

    # aar "Gracias, Sra. ... Gracias, [bet]."
    aar "Thank you, Miss... Thank you, [bet]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1257
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_411eccb5:

    # bet "¡Es increíble! Ya me parecía increíble lo de las pruebas de embarazo, pero esto..."
    bet "That's unbelievable! I already thought the pregnancy tests were hard to believe, but this..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1258
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_af4552c0:

    # mc "Aún estoy asombrado. ¿Te ves preparada para hacerlo?"
    mc "I'm still amazed. Are you qualified to do it?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1260
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_0cb66e63:

    # bet "No hay nadie preparado para hacerlo en el mundo, excepto el tal Daniels, quizás. Ha tenido años para familiarizarse con cerebros que envejecen aceleradamente."
    bet "There is no one qualified to do it in the world, except perhaps Daniels. He has had years to familiarize himself with rapidly aging brains."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1261
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_12e76d7a:

    # bet "Y estoy segura de que no soy la mejor opción para hacer esa operación, pero dudo que otros cirujanos con más reputación estuvieran dispuestos a hacerla."
    bet "And I'm sure I'm not the best choice for this operation, but I doubt that other surgeons with a better reputation would be willing to do it."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1262
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_e59d24df:

    # mc "Es comprensible. Por lo ilegal y porque habría que darles una información que no creo que NTR esté preparada para dar aún."
    mc "It's understandable. Because it's illegal and because it would require giving them information that I don't think NTR is ready to give out yet."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1264
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_25231bcf:

    # bet "*Risa* Decirle a alguien '¿Quieres hacer una operación ilegal en alguien que no debería existir?' no es la mejor forma de establecer un primer contacto."
    bet "*Laugh* Saying to someone, 'Do you want to perform an illegal surgery on someone who shouldn't exist?' isn't the best way to make a first impression."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1265
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_cc2bcafa:

    # mc "*Risa* Desde luego que no."
    mc "*Laugh* Of course not."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1267
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_f5e9527a:

    # mc "Hablando de cosas que no deberían existir... ¿Quieres hacerte la prueba de embarazo?"
    mc "Talking about things that shouldn't exist... Do you want to take a pregnancy test?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1269
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_36f8ec43:

    # bet "No hace falta. Tengo una edad y..."
    bet "No need. At my age..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1270
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_772dccd7:

    # mc "Y me dijiste que las mujeres de la familia son fértiles hasta edades muy avanzadas..."
    mc "You told me that the women in this family are fertile until a very advanced age..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1272
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_d0baac51:

    # bet "Sí, pero no es lo que iba a decir. Mañana por la mañana me voy a Florida. Si hiciéramos la prueba ahora, no estaría lista cuando me fuera."
    bet "Yes, but that's not what I was going to say. I'm leaving for Florida tomorrow morning. If we did the test now, it wouldn't be ready by the time I leave."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1273
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_a9a4d97a:

    # bet "Si me hiciera la prueba, querría ver el resultado contigo. Habrá tiempo cuando vuelva de Florida, especialmente si voy a Aruba contigo."
    bet "If I took the test, I would want to see the results with you. There will be time when I get back from Florida, especially if I go to Aruba with you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1274
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_f5271567:

    # mc "Me parece una buena idea."
    mc "I think that's a good idea."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1277
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_1717c583:

    # bet "Voy a mi habitación a coger el móvil. Tengo ganas de recibir la información y empezar a estudiarla."
    bet "I'm going to my room to get my cell phone. I'm eager to receive the data and begin studying it."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1278
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_b8fcea38:

    # bet "Te veo luego, [mc]."
    bet "See you later, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1280
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_0eb93267:

    # mc "Te veo luego, [bet]."
    mc "See you later, [bet]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1282
translate english c27s002_AaronVC_9f881016:

    # mc "Te veo luego, Tía [bet]."
    mc "See you later, Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1289
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_02f19c98:

    # "Mientras tanto, en el salón de [nor]..."
    "Meanwhile, in [nor]'s living room..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1290
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_2835e1d0:

    # kia "Lo siento, [nor], pero ya lo hemos decidido."
    kia "I'm sorry, [nor], but we've already made a decision."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1291
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_dbe376fe:

    # eil "No digas 'hemos decidido', Mamá. Di 'has decidido'. Yo no quiero irme. [eri] incluso me ha ofrecido compartir habitación cuando lleguen las chicas nuevas."
    eil "Don't say 'we've decided', Mom. Say 'you've decided'. I don't want to go. [eri] even offered to share her room with me when the new girls arrive."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1292
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_83b58739:

    # nor "No quiero meterme entre vosotras dos, pero si [eil] quiere quedarse en casa, es bienvenida."
    nor "I don't want to get between you two, but if [eil] wants to stay here, she's welcome to."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1294
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_b3d68f5a:

    # kia "Es nuestra casa. Deberíamos vivir allí una vez Solomon se vaya y podamos volver."
    kia "It's our house. We should live there once Solomon leaves and we can go back."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1295
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_c13f6344:

    # kia "Quiero dejar de ser una carga para ti. Suficiente trabajo tendrás una vez lleguen las chicas nuevas."
    kia "I want to stop being a burden to you. You'll have enough work once the new girls arrive."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1297
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_680bf2d7:

    # nor "No dais ningún trabajo, [kia]. ¿Comida? Viváis donde viváis espero que vengáis a comer o cenar todos los días."
    nor "You living here doesn't give me any extra work, [kia]. Food? Wherever you live, I hope you come over for lunch or dinner every day."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1298
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_94bf2c09:

    # nor "Me fastidia que [sam] y [sim], [oma], [mad.nick], o [meg] sólo vengan un par de días por semana, tres como mucho, pero ellas nunca han vivido aquí."
    nor "It annoys me that [sam] and [sim], [oma], [mad.nick], or [meg] only come a couple of days a week, three at most, but they never lived here."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1299
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_adfdc780:

    # nor "Si lo hicierais vosotras después de estas dos semanas... Sería como si la casa estuviera vacía."
    nor "If you did it after these two weeks. It would be like the house was empty."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1301
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_ad86e822:

    # eil "Bueno, más trabajo sí que damos. Hay más lavadoras que poner..."
    eil "Well, we certainly do give you more work. There's more laundry to do..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1303
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_201ecad1:

    # nor "¿Cuántas lavadoras has puesto en la última semana, [eil]? ¿Cuántas ha puesto tu madre?"
    nor "How many loads of laundry have you done in the last week, [eil]? How many has your mother done?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1304
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_501253ad:

    # nor "¡Desde que vivís aquí, pongo menos lavadoras que nunca! Entre vosotras y mi madre me estáis quitando un montón de trabajo."
    nor "Since you've been living here, I've been doing less laundry than ever! Between you and my mother, you're taking a lot of work off my hands."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1306
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_89ee9a5f:

    # kia "Pero los gastos... La factura de la luz, del agua... la comida... todo eso te tiene que ocasionar gastos..."
    kia "But the expenses... The electricity bill, the water bill... food... all of that must cost you money..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1308
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_20ae6ea4:

    # nor "Aún no ha llegado ninguna factura desde que estáis aquí, pero no creo que sea mucho el incremento, por mucho rato que os paséis con el secador."
    nor "No bills have arrived since you've been here, but I don't think it will be much, no matter how long you spend with the hair dryer."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1309
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_81f0583b:

    # nor "¿Quieres pagar por esos gastos? No seas ridícula, [kia]. No sois inquilinas. Sois familia."
    nor "Do you want to pay for those expenses? Don't be ridiculous, [kia]. You're not tenants. You're family."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1312
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_a908e873:

    # nor "Hablando de familia. ¿Ya le has dicho a [mc] lo del divorcio?"
    nor "Speaking of family, have you told [mc] about the divorce yet?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1314
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_9eedc9e1:

    # kia "No, y le pedí a [oma] que no le dijera nada. No quiero decirle nada hasta no haber decidido dónde vamos a vivir."
    kia "No, and I asked [oma] not to say anything to him. I didn't want to tell him anything until we had decided where we were going to live."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1315
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_169a5014:

    # kia "Si lo supiera, seguro que me presionaría para que nos quedáramos aquí."
    kia "If he knew, he would surely pressure me to stay here."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1317
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_14da87d0:

    # eil "Aún no conoces a [mc] lo suficiente, Mamá. Él buscaría soluciones y argumentos para que no te fueras."
    eil "You don't know [mc] well enough yet, Mom. He would look for solutions and reasons for you not to leave."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1318
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_482ce281:

    # eil "Pero no te presionaría. La decisión es tuya y él la aceptará. Sólo te propondrá alternativas."
    eil "But he wouldn't pressure you. The decision is yours, and he will accept it. He would only suggest alternatives."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1320
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_0ccef5d8:

    # kia "¿Y crees que eso no sería una forma de presión? Llevamos juntos diez días y le digo que me voy de casa para vivir en nuestra casa."
    kia "And you don't think that would be a form of pressure? We've been together for ten days and I can't tell him I'm leaving home to live in our house."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1321
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_f398d692:

    # kia "Si empieza a proponer alternativas y las rechazo todas... parecerá que no quiero vivir en la misma casa que él..."
    kia "If he starts suggesting alternatives and I reject them all... it will seem like I don't want to live in the same home as him."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1322
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_d384f096:

    # kia "Por eso es mejor hacerlo ahora que lo hemos decidido."
    kia "That's why it's better to do it now that we've decided."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1325
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_e37e927c:

    # kia "Bueno, da lo mismo. Nos iremos de casa para vivir en nuestra casa. Ya te he dicho que lo hemos decidido."
    kia "Well, whatever. We're leaving home to live in our house. I already told you we've made up our minds."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1327
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_e30ee04a:

    # eil "Y yo te he dicho que no 'hemos decidido' nada. Tú has tomado tu decisión. Yo la mía."
    eil "And I told you that we haven't decided anything. You've made your decision. I've made mine."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1328
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_83a18851:

    # eil "[nor] ha dicho que soy bienvenida, con lo que me voy a quedar aquí."
    eil "[nor] said I'm welcome, so I'm going to stay here."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1330
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_298ea3bb:

    # nor "¿De verdad quieres volver a vivir en esa casa? ¿Tú sola?"
    nor "Do you really want to go back to living in that house? All by yourself?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1331
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_24e69273:

    # nor "Lo único que te va a traer son malos recuerdos. Si [eil] fuera contigo, podríais crear recuerdos nuevos."
    nor "All it'll do is bring back bad memories. If [eil] were there with you, you could make new memories."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1332
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_18f3a71a:

    # nor "Pero le he ofrecido quedarse, ha aceptado, y no voy a retirar la invitación."
    nor "But I have offered her to stay, she has accepted, and I am not going to withdraw the invitation."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1334
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_d378074d:

    # kia "Lo sé, pero no es que quiera. Es que debo. Me estáis haciendo sentir incómoda con tanta amabilidad."
    kia "I know, but it's not that I want to. It's that I have to. You're making me feel uncomfortable with all your kindness."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1335
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_dc33e4a4:

    # kia "Una vez Solomon se vaya de casa, las circunstancias que os obligaron a acogernos habrán desaparecido."
    kia "Once Solomon leaves the house, the circumstances that forced you to take us in will no longer exist."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1337
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_f5ed110f:

    # nor "*Risa* ¿Obligado? ¿Te has dado un golpe en la cabeza?"
    nor "*Laugh* Forced? Did you hit your head?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1338
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_f21ef800:

    # nor "Que viváis aquí es una de las mejores cosas que le han pasado a esta familia."
    nor "You living here is one of the best things that has ever happened to this family."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1339
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_da6f0423:

    # nor "¡Entre vosotras, las estudiantes, mi madre y mi tía, la casa está más viva que nunca!"
    nor "With you, the students, my mother, and my aunt, the house is livelier than ever!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1341
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_5744ade3:

    # bet "He oído que alguien me nombraba... ¿Qué estáis discutiendo, si puedo preguntarlo?"
    bet "I heard someone mention me... What are you discussing, if I may ask?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1343
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_a7808cc3:

    # nor "Hola, Tía [bet]."
    nor "Hello, Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1344
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_a2fa1dd8:

    # eil "Mi madre se ha vuelto idiota y quiere volver a nuestra casa..."
    eil "My mother has become idiotic and wants to move back into our old house..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1345
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_503cd810:

    # kia "¡[eil]!"
    kia "[eil]!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1347
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_5974aad6:

    # bet "Desde luego que te has vuelto idiota. ¿Quieres volver a vivir con Solomon?"
    bet "You've definitely gone idiotic. Do you want to go back to living with Solomon?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1349
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_a45339fc:

    # bet "¿Ahora que estás con [mc]? ¿Estás loca?"
    bet "Now that you're with [mc]? Are you crazy?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1351
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_a8f10047:

    # kia "No, no sería vivir con Solomon. Me ha pedido el divorcio y me cede la casa. Se irá... no sé cuándo se irá."
    kia "No, it wouldn't be living with Solomon. He asked me for a divorce and is giving me the house. He'll leave... I don't know when he'll leave."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1353
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_798b8523:

    # nor "Y como [kia] ya era idiota de antes, cree que es una carga en casa y por eso quiere volver allí."
    nor "And since [kia] was already an idiot before, she thinks she's a burden at home and that's why she wants to go back there."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1354
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_56a3b283:

    # kia "*Risa* ¡[nor]! ¿Todo el mundo va a llamarme idiota hoy?"
    kia "*Laugh* [nor]! Is everyone going to call me an idiot today?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1355
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_9cf97917:

    # eil "*Risa* Tiene razón. No en que seas una carga, claro. Ya querías irte antes de la fiesta de cumpleaños."
    eil "*Laugh* She's right. Not in that you're a burden, of course. You wanted to leave before the birthday party."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1356
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_e37d0cb8:

    # eil "Si todo el mundo te llama idiota, por algo será..."
    eil "If everyone calls you an idiot, there must be a reason..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1358
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_6ec5ceb3:

    # bet "¿Puedo hacerte una propuesta, [kia]?"
    bet "May I make you an offer, [kia]?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1359
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_959b35cb:

    # bet "Conseguirías lo que quieres y todas conseguiríamos que sigas viviendo 'en casa', que es lo que queremos el resto."
    bet "You would get what you want, and we would all get to have you continue living 'at home', which is what the rest of us want."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1360
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_63f50414:

    # bet "¿Cuántas habitaciones tiene tu casa?"
    bet "How many bedrooms does your old house have?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1362
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_cb585557:

    # kia "Cuatro, pero no lo entiendo. Son cosas incompatibles. O vivo aquí o no vivo aquí."
    kia "Four, but I don't understand. They're incompatible things. Either I live here or I don't."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1363
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_f44a2ca6:

    # kia "¿Y qué tiene que ver el número de habitaciones?"
    kia "And what does the number of rooms have to do with it?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1365
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_922dfd9c:

    # bet "[eri] y yo tenemos un plan. ¿Nos acogerías a [mee] y a mí durante unos meses?"
    bet "[eri] and I have a plan. Would you take [mee] and me in for a few months?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1366
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_be97a80a:

    # bet "¿Y estarías interesada en vender tu casa y que construyéramos una aquí cerca si podemos comprar la parcela y construir en ella?"
    bet "And would you be interested in selling your house and having us build one nearby if we can buy the plot and build on it?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1368
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_a16bddfb:

    # eil "¿Qué?" (multiple=2)
    eil "What?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1369
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_6fbc6d77:

    # kia "*Jadeo* ¿QUÉ?" (multiple=2)
    kia "*Gasp* WHAT?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1370
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_3d5b5aa0:

    # nor "¿Qué? ¿Qué parcela, Tía [bet]?"
    nor "What? What plot, Auntie?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1372
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_fe3866ab:

    # bet "Una de las que hay al otro lado de la carretera, o la de más allá de casa de [mar]."
    bet "One of the ones across the road, or the one beyond [mar]'s house."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1373
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_2f0196e1:

    # bet "Si conseguimos comprarla, voy a proponerle a [mee] que, en vez de comprar o alquilar algo en el centro, construyamos una casa ahí."
    bet "If we manage to buy it, I'm going to suggest to [mee] that, instead of buying or renting something in the downtown area, we build a house here."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1374
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_7093ea9b:

    # bet "Si [kia] quiere, puede unirse a la iniciativa y podemos construir una casa más grande."
    bet "If [kia] wants, she can join the initiative, and we can build a bigger house."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1376
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_e8b9b26a:

    # eil "¡Di que sí, Mamá!"
    eil "Say yes, Mom!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1377
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_c139524e:

    # kia "¡Me encantaría!"
    kia "I would love to!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1379
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_adfd03f6:

    # bet "¡Estupendo! Tendríamos que saber quiénes son los dueños de la parcela que elijamos, y saber si podremos construir."
    bet "Great! We'll need to find out who owns the plot we choose and whether we'll be able to build on it."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1380
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_b27cf8bf:

    # bet "Supongo que después habrá que pedir permisos de construcción, pero de eso se ocupará [mee] si la convenzo..."
    bet "I suppose that afterwards we will have to apply for building permits, but [mee] will take care of that if I can convince her..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1382
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_bf87f68f:

    # nor "*Risa*"
    nor "*Laughter*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1384
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_f2d2447c:

    # bet "¿De qué te ríes, [nor]?"
    bet "What are you laughing at, [nor]?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1386
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_63896659:

    # nor "Las tres parcelas que hay al otro lado de la carretera, las tres de detrás de las casas, y la que hay más allá de casa de [mar] no las podréis comprar."
    nor "You can't buy any of the three plots across the road, the three behind the houses, and the one beyond [mar]'s house."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1387
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_41086b3d:

    # nor "La propietaria es una bruja que no os las va a vender."
    nor "The owner is a witch who won't sell them to you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1388
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_2328c337:

    # nor "¡Son mías desde hace años! Las compró Mike para que nadie pudiera construir cerca nuestro."
    nor "They've been mine for years! Mike bought them so no one could build near us."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1389
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_b6a58c0b:

    # nor "Os las cederé gustosa, con un par de condiciones."
    nor "I'll gladly give them to you, with a couple of conditions."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1391
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_ecbc4eeb:

    # nor "La primera es que mientras dure la construcción, vendréis todos los días a comer y a cenar."
    nor "The first one is that, while construction lasts, you will come every day for lunch and dinner."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1392
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_3e7ede50:

    # nor "La segunda es que te unas al proyecto de mi madre y mi tía."
    nor "The second one is that you join my mom and aunt's project."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1393
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_9b067bcf:

    # nor "Y no vas a dejar que dos ancianitas se tengan que ir lejos de su familia por no unirte a ellas, ¿verdad?"
    nor "And you're not going to let two old ladies be forced to move far away from their family because you won't join them, are you?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1395
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_dac768f2:

    # eil "¿Qué? ¿Son tuyas?" (multiple=2)
    eil "What? You own them?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1396
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_96439efb:

    # kia "¿Qué? ¡Claro que me uniría!" (multiple=2)
    kia "What? Of course I'll join!" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1398
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_92cfab91:

    # bet "¿Qué?"
    bet "What?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1400
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_13a3db2e:

    # nor "*Risa* ¿Por qué creéis que mi parcela es más pequeña que la de [mar] y no tiene piscina?"
    nor "*Laugh* Why do you think my plot is smaller than [mar]'s and doesn't have a pool?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1401
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_b3bb7bc0:

    # nor "Mike se dejó un dineral en esas parcelas. Siempre quiso que las usara alguien de la familia cuando se quisiera independizar."
    nor "Mike spent a fortune on those plots. He always wanted someone in the family to use them when they wanted to move out on their own."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1402
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_f7d79988:

    # nor "Creo que estaría contento de que seáis vosotras, aunque nunca le cayó muy bien Mamá."
    nor "I think he would be happy if it were you, even though he never liked Mom much."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1404
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_c2c8a80f:

    # bet "*Risa* Esto parece el inicio del 'Barrio Marks'."
    bet "*Laugh* This sounds like the beginning of 'The Marks Neighborhood'."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1406
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_85364476:

    # "Las cuatro mujeres empiezan a hacer planes sobre la construcción de la casa."
    "The four women start making plans for building the new house."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1407
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_e452ac4f:

    # "Son castillos en el aire, ya que ni siquiera [nor] sabe qué hay que hacer para construir en esas parcelas."
    "They are pipe dreams, since not even [nor] knows what needs to be done to build on those plots."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1408
translate english c27s002_KiaEilNor_9ab84de7:

    # "Pero la ilusión de no separar a la familia es mayor que la posibilidad de que surjan problemas."
    "But the desire to keep the family together is stronger than the possibility of problems arising."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1413
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_325ec4ea:

    # "Pocos minutos después de que [bet] se haya ido..."
    "A few minutes after [bet] leaves..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1414
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_7dda0259:

    # "*Ring-Ring*"
    "*Ring-Ring*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1416
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_feac9063:

    # mc "Hola, [ama]. ¿Cómo ha ido?"
    mc "Hello, [ama]. How did it go?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1418
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_2389a3ff:

    # ama "¡Horrible! ¡Odio a los Washington!"
    ama "Horrible! I hate the Washingtons!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1419
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_29714f61:

    # mc "¿Qué ha pasado?"
    mc "What happened?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1421
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_ded31857:

    # ama "¡[sam] me ha hecho comer dos raciones de pierogi!"
    ama "[sam] forced me to eat two servings of pierogi!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1422
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_82e20e44:

    # ama "¡Casi no puedo moverme! Voy a tener que correr muchos kilómetros en la cinta para quemar todas esas calorías."
    ama "I can hardly move! I'm going to have to run a lot of miles on the treadmill to burn off all those extra calories."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1423
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_d1ca4ed9:

    # mc "*Risa* Los pierogi de [sam.nick] están buenísimos."
    mc "*Laugh* [sam.nick]'s pierogi are delicious."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1425
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_61725a62:

    # ama "¡Están deliciosos! Pero después de los primeros diez..."
    ama "They're so yummy! But after the first ten..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1426
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_8d2ab383:

    # ama "Ahora mismo estoy mirando por el retrovisor con miedo de que salga con una bandeja para que me la lleve a la base."
    ama "Right now, I'm looking in the rearview mirror, afraid that she'll come out with a tray for me to take back to the base."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1427
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_a34d9996:

    # mc "¿Te has comido diez pierogis? No me extraña que no puedas moverte."
    mc "Did you eat ten pierogis? No wonder you can't move."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1429
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_99f222e0:

    # ama "He dicho los primeros diez... [sam.nick] me ha obligado a seguir comiendo..."
    ama "I said the first ten... [sam.nick] forced me to keep eating..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1430
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_2a9865b8:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Qué hacía Jamaal mientras tanto?"
    mc "*Laugh* What was Jamaal doing in the meantime?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1432
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_2f2c36d8:

    # ama "Fingía llorar en un rincón porque me estaba comiendo sus pierogis. Pero finge muy mal. Se le escapaba la risa."
    ama "He pretended to cry in a corner because I was eating his pierogis. But he's a terrible actor. He couldn't stop laughing."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1433
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_58c545e8:

    # ama "Había comida para alimentar un regimiento de soldados hambrientos."
    ama "There was enough food to feed a regiment of hungry soldiers."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1434
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_1d179161:

    # mc "Acostúmbrate a las comidas de [sam]."
    mc "Get used to [sam]'s meals."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1435
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_6cb4d253:

    # mc "¿Y el otro tema? ¿Cómo ha ido?"
    mc "What about the other issue? How did that go?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1437
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_7354ada8:

    # ama "Igual de mal. Pero al final ha firmado."
    ama "Just as bad. But in the end, she signed the papers."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1438
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_a0eb44d1:

    # mc "Si ha firmado no habrá ido tan mal, ¿no?"
    mc "If she signed, it couldn't have been that bad, right?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1439
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_ee7272f3:

    # ama "Jamaal les ha hecho entrar en razón, aunque parezca mentira."
    ama "Jamaal made them see reason, believe it or not."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1440
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_9dce10b0:

    # mc "A veces Jam es el más racional de esa familia. Algunas veces. De vez en cuando. En extrañas ocasiones."
    mc "Sometimes Jam is the most rational member of that family. Occasionally. From time to time. Once in a blue moon."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1442
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_fda6152b:

    # ama "No esperes agradecimiento de [sim], por cierto. Me han sacado que había sido idea mía."
    ama "Don't expect any thanks from [sim], by the way. They found out it was my idea."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1443
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_9dff03c6:

    # mc "¿Te han tendido una trampa y has caído? ¿En plan 'No te va a pasar nada si dices que la idea ha sido tuya'?"
    mc "Have they set a trap for you and you've fallen for it? Like, 'Nothing will happen if you say it was your idea'?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1445
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_604b1170:

    # ama "¡Exactamente eso! O más bien 'Estaríamos agradecidas si nos dices que has sido tú'."
    ama "Exactly! Or rather, 'We would be grateful if you would let us know that it was you'."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1446
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_6a084b8d:

    # ama "A veces odio a los civiles. ¡Estáis llenos de estratagemas traicioneras!"
    ama "Sometimes I hate you, civilians. You're always coming up with treacherous schemes!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1447
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_15cb9e7b:

    # mc "*Risa* Eso es lo que se siente cuando tienes una madre, [ama]. Le acabarás cogiendo el gusto."
    mc "*Laugh* That's what it's like when you have a mother, [ama]. You'll end up liking it."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1449
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_53243ded:

    # ama "Bueno, voy a ir a la universidad a formalizar la inscripción de [sim]."
    ama "Well, I'm going to go to the university to complete [sim]'s enrollment."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1450
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_cc7f096d:

    # mc "Ya que vas, ¿me puedes hacer un favor?"
    mc "While you're there, can you do me a favor?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1451
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_63831521:

    # ama "Sí, dime qué necesitas."
    ama "Yes, tell me what you need."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1452
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_25177f8c:

    # mc "Matricula a [eil] también. En este caso, que lo cobren de mi cuenta."
    mc "Please register [eil] as well. In this case, please have the tuition charged to my account."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1454
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_d6403d39:

    # ama "¿[eil]? No tengo su expediente. No sé en qué carrera tengo que matricularla..."
    ama "[eil]? I don't have her file. I don't know which degree I need to enroll her in..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1455
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_cf25dae0:

    # mc "No te preocupes. Tienen el expediente en la universidad. Dejó la carrera el año pasado por culpa de Solomon."
    mc "Don't worry. They have her file at the university. She dropped out last year because of Solomon."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1456
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_9472e3ca:

    # mc "Ahora que he cobrado el primer sueldo, puedo pagarle la inscripción para su último año. No tiene por qué pagar los errores de su padre."
    mc "Now that I've received my first paycheck, I can pay for her senior year tuition. She shouldn't have to pay for her father's mistakes."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1458
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_f25db8ed:

    # ama "Es muy generoso por tu parte, pero no sé si podré hacerlo. Me costó conseguir una plaza para [sim], y..."
    ama "That's very generous of you, but I don't know if I'll be able to do it. It was hard enough to get a slot for [sim] and..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1459
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_3c7d659d:

    # mc "Si te ponen algún problema, pide ver al Decano Jonas y dile que vas de mi parte."
    mc "If you encounter any problems, ask to see Dean Jonas and tell him I sent you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1461
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_b3e3dff0:

    # ama "Lo haré. Voy a ir yendo, antes de que se haga más tarde. Te veo luego."
    ama "I will. I'll get going before it gets too late. See you later."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1462
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege1_ec8c6a24:

    # mc "Hasta luego, [ama]."
    mc "See you later, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1477
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_63770401:

    # "Pasas un rato leyendo los informes financieros que te ha enviado Aaron. La contabilidad de Daniels era como mínimo 'creativa'."
    "You spend some time reading the financial reports Aaron sent you. Daniels' accounting was 'creative', to say the least."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1478
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_0ff8066f:

    # "La doble contabilidad es para novatos. Lo de Daniels, o lo de sus contables para ser más exactos, es verdadero arte para ocultar ingresos."
    "Double accounting is for amateurs. What Daniels did, or rather what his accountants did, to be more precise, is a true art form when it comes to hiding income."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1480
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1481
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_45867f07:

    # lis "*A través de la puerta* Soy yo, ¿puedo pasar?"
    lis "*Through the door* It's me, may I come in?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1482
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_8bd4ab17:

    # mc "Entra, [lis]."
    mc "Come in, [lis]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1486
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_f23fa279:

    # lis "Hola, [mc]."
    lis "Hi, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1488
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_b6034917:

    # mc "Hola, Princesa. ¿Puedo ayudarte en algo?"
    mc "Hello, Princess. Can I help you with anything?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1490
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_dad9dfe9:

    # mc "Hola, [lis]. ¿Puedo ayudarte en algo?"
    mc "Hello, [lis]. Can I help you with anything?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1492
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_31d57116:

    # lis "Venía a ver la cama nueva. ¡Es enorme! Van a ser geniales los abrazos de los domingos."
    lis "I came to see the new bed. It's huge! Sunday hugs are going to be great."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1493
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_2513e8f2:

    # mc "*Risa* En el momento en que se corra la voz sobre los abrazos, estaremos 23 ahí. No sé si cabremos."
    mc "*Laugh* By the time word gets out about the hugs, there'll be 23 of us there. I don't know if we'll all fit."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1494
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_251565a1:

    # mc "Creo que será mejor mover los abrazos al jardín de [nor]. Allí se podría unir incluso Jamaal. *Risa* Aquí no va a subir."
    mc "I think it would be better to move the hugs to [nor]'s garden. Jamaal could even join us there. *Laugh* He won't be coming up here."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1496
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_8aadbf33:

    # lis "Hablando de Jamaal..."
    lis "Speaking of Jamaal..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1497
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_fcd7fd98:

    # mc "¿Qué pasa con él?"
    mc "What's going on with him?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1499
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_43b3e756:

    # lis "Esta mañana he visto a Anthony en la universidad. Me ha dicho que los viste juntos..."
    lis "This morning, I ran into Anthony at the university. He told me that you saw them together..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1500
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_68b347b2:

    # mc "Sí. No sabía que él me había visto."
    mc "Yes. I didn't know he saw me."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1501
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_a9ef2025:

    # lis "Bueno, por lo visto se lo ha dicho Jamaal... Y que te ha dicho que salen juntos..."
    lis "Well, apparently, Jamaal told him.. And that he told you that they're hanging out together..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1502
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_fb2bf9d3:

    # mc "¿Y hay algún problema con eso? Supongo que tú no tienes ningún problema con que salgan juntos."
    mc "And is there a problem with that? I guess you don't have anything against them going out together."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1504
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_e004ddcd:

    # mc "Tú sales conmigo y Anthony con Jamaal. No veo que haya ningún problema."
    mc "You are dating me, and Anthony is dating Jamaal. I don't see any issue with that."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1506
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_2780200c:

    # lis "No lo digo por mí. Lo digo por ti."
    lis "I'm not saying this for myself. I'm saying it for you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1507
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_2fd84506:

    # mc "¿Por mí? Yo me alegro mucho por Jamaal. Anthony es un tipo afortunado si está saliendo con él."
    mc "Me? I'm really happy for Jamaal. Anthony is a lucky guy if he's dating him."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1508
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_9c1b2634:

    # mc "*Risa* Y negaré haber dicho eso si alguna vez Jamaal me pregunta."
    mc "*Laugh* And I'll deny saying that if Jamaal ever asks me."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1510
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_eb66a83e:

    # lis "Espera... ¿qué te ha contado Jamaal sobre Anthony?"
    lis "Wait... what did Jamaal tell you about Anthony?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1511
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_9bfad9b5:

    # mc "Todo. Cómo se conocieron, que tenía dudas sobre su sexualidad cuando estaba intentándolo contigo, cómo empezaron a salir cuando por fin se decidió..."
    mc "Everything. How they met, that he had doubts about his sexuality when he was trying to date you, how they started dating when he finally made up his mind..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1512
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_518fd08d:

    # mc "¿Por qué lo preguntas?"
    mc "Why do you ask?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1514
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_ad2d1023:

    # lis "Me parece raro que no hagas ninguna broma ingeniosa sobre que Jamaal ha acabado saliendo con una chica."
    lis "I find it strange that you don't make any clever jokes about Jamaal ending up dating a girl."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1515
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_e4ee6cd0:

    # lis "Aunque Anthony ya no es una chica, claro. Pero ya sabes... hay gente que no acepta a los trans o que hacen bromas de mal gusto."
    lis "Although Anthony isn't a girl anymore, of course. But you know... there are people who don't accept trans people or who make bad jokes."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1516
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_4f2d4076:

    # mc "¿Ves? Eso no me lo había contado."
    mc "See? He didn't tell me about that."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1518
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_c0728b24:

    # lis "¡Oops! ¡Acabo de meter la pata!"
    lis "Oops! I just messed up!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1520
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_b54e7bab:

    # lis "Cuando has dicho que te lo había contado todo y lo de sus dudas..."
    lis "When you said that he had told you everything, including his doubts..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1521
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_191e4e86:

    # mc "Bueno, parece que me ha contado todo lo que creía que yo debía saber en ese momento."
    mc "Well, it seems like he told me everything he thought I needed to know at that moment."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1522
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_4e762e96:

    # mc "Me dijo que había cosas que no tenía el derecho a contarme. Supongo que se refería a esto."
    mc "He told me there were things he didn't have the right to tell me. I guess he meant this."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1523
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_25464f9e:

    # mc "Pero me da lo mismo. Jamaal está contento y supongo que Anthony también. Es suficiente para mí."
    mc "But I don't care. Jamaal is happy, and I guess Anthony is too. That's good enough for me."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1525
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_88a8e731:

    # lis "Sí. Está muy contento. Lo ha pasado mal y estaba... confuso."
    lis "Yes. He's very happy. He's been through a lot and was... confused."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1526
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_fd2a5197:

    # lis "Cuando me lo explicó se sentía avergonzado, tanto por nuestra situación como por lo que ha tenido que pasar."
    lis "When he explained it to me, he felt ashamed, both because of our situation and because of what he had been through."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1527
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_8faabc56:

    # lis "Me hizo prometer que no se lo contaría a nadie que lo conociera..."
    lis "He made me promise not to tell anyone who knew him..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1528
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_73d90374:

    # mc "*Risa* Y me lo has contado a mí por error. ¡Me encantan esos malentendidos!"
    mc "*Laugh* And you told me by mistake. I love misunderstandings like that!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1530
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_b732c400:

    # lis "*Risa* ¡Me has dicho que te lo había explicado todo!"
    lis "*Laugh* You told me he explained everything to you!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1531
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_671594a4:

    # mc "*Risa* Yo creía que me lo había explicado todo."
    mc "*Laugh* I thought he had explained everything to me."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1532
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_2379b883:

    # mc "Pero no te preocupes. A mí no se me escapará."
    mc "But don't worry. I won't spill the beans to anyone."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1534
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_43773600:

