    lis "You're a dick!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1535
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_aae7dd80:

    # mc "Es posible. *Risa* Me lo dicen mucho."
    mc "It's possible. *Laugh* People say that a lot."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1537
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_b623dc96:

    # mc "Pero soy tu capullo."
    mc "But I'm your dick."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1540
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_9f913e33:

    # lis "En eso tienes razón."
    lis "You're right about that."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1541
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_263518b6:

    # lis "Bueno, me voy, que tengo que coger el bus para ir a la tienda de [mad.nick]."
    lis "Well, I'm off, I have to catch the bus to go to [mad.nick]'s store."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1542
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_aea36704:

    # mc "¿Vas a comprar más ropa? ¿No tienes suficientes con las cuatro maletas que trajiste?"
    mc "Are you going to buy more clothes? Don't you have enough with the four suitcases you brought?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1543
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_04d73e84:

    # mc "Mas todo lo que después trajeron los transportistas, claro. Tienes suerte de que tu habitación sea tan grande como la de [emm]."
    mc "Plus everything the movers brought later, of course. You're lucky your room is as big as [emm]'s."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1546
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_b5799758:

    # lis "*Risa* ¿Vas a decirle a tu princesa cuánta ropa tiene que tener?"
    lis "*Laugh* Are you going to tell your princess how much clothes she should have?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1548
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_2e1ef9f2:

    # lis "*Risa* ¿Vas a decirle a una chica cuánta ropa tiene que tener?"
    lis "*Laugh* Are you going to tell a girl how much clothes she should have?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1549
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_b71b8e6f:

    # lis "Parece mentira que te hayas criado rodeado de mujeres."
    lis "It's hard to believe you grew up surrounded by women."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1550
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_e042d083:

    # mc "No me atrevería nunca a decir algo así. *Risa* Sólo preguntaba."
    mc "I would never dare to say such a thing. *Laugh* I was just asking."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1551
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_eb84c7af:

    # mc "Pero no hace falta que cojas el bus. Tengo que ir al centro a comprar unas cosas yo también."
    mc "But you don't have to take the bus. I have to go downtown to buy a few things too."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1552
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_08226d17:

    # mc "Las iba a comprar ayer, pero al encontrarme con Jamaal se me hizo tarde y me olvidé."
    mc "I was going to buy them yesterday, but I ran into Jamaal and got held up, so I forgot."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1554
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_e8aab443:

    # lis "¡Genial! Voy a coger el bolso y te espero abajo."
    lis "Great! I'll grab my bag and meet you downstairs."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1555
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_2cbcdd4a:

    # mc "¿Vas a ir así?"
    mc "Are you going to go like that?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1557
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_a4d0d076:

    # lis "¿No te gusta?"
    lis "Don't you like it?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1558
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_fa5a65c6:

    # mc "¡Me encanta! Pero me sorprende que quieras ir así fuera de casa. Hace unas semanas te hubieras preocupado por si te veía algún conocido."
    mc "I love it! But I'm surprised you want to go out like that. A few weeks ago, you would have been worried about someone you know seeing you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1560
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_d9877bfa:

    # lis "Hace unas semanas no sabía lo que era ser libre de todas esas tonterías."
    lis "A few weeks ago, I didn't know what it was like to be free from all that nonsense."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1561
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_60799f78:

