    mc "Make it two minutes."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1572
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_c851925d:

    # "Conduces hasta la tienda de [mad.nick] y decides entrar a saludar."
    "You drive to [mad.nick]'s shop and decide to go in and say hello."

