    "When you arrive at the store, [mad.nick] is busy with a customer."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1575
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_0db051fb:

    # mad "Buenas tardes, [lis] y [mc]. Dadme un segundo para que acabe una cosa."
    mad "Good afternoon, [lis] and [mc]. Give me a second to finish this."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1576
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_64f9baa0:

    # mc "No te preocupes."
    mc "Don't worry, take your time."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1577
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_82c8f35a:

    # lis "Voy a ir mirando algo de ropa mientras acabas."
    lis "I'll look at some clothes while you finish up."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1579
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_5b55aa52:

    # lis "Deberíamos haber venido antes. Cada vez que la madre de [mad.nick] viene, la pone de mal humor."
    lis "We should have come earlier. Every time [mad.nick]'s mother comes, it puts her in a bad mood."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1580
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_fa0df493:

    # mc "¿Es su madre?"
    mc "Is that her mother?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1582
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_9326a7d2:

    # lis "Sí, y su jefa. Tienen varias tiendas en el condado. Ella es la encargada de la tienda de Atascadero."
    lis "Yes, and her boss. They have several stores in the county. She is in charge of the Atascadero store."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1584
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_d8306e1e:

    # mcp "(Ahora entiendo por qué no quería que le mandara las pruebas del chantaje a su jefe.)"
    mcp "(Now I understand why she didn't want me to send the blackmail evidence to her boss.)"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1585
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_9adfb6ba:

    # mcp "(Hubiera sido malo si sólo hubiera sido su jefe, pero si además es su madre...)"
    mcp "(It would have been bad enough if she was just her boss, but if she's also her mother...)"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1586
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_de51f75b:

    # mc "No tenía ni idea."
    mc "I had no idea."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1588
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_7d909430:

    # lis "Cuando se trata de trabajo, la Sra. Chang no trata a [mad.nick] como a una hija sino como a una empleada."
    lis "When it comes to work, Mrs. Chang does not treat [mad.nick] like a daughter but like an employee."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1589
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_a8f4664c:

    # lis "Y para dar ejemplo al resto de dependientas, es especialmente estricta con ella. Para que nadie la acuse de favoritismo."
    lis "And to set an example for the other sales assistants, she is especially strict with her. So that no one can accuse her of playing favorites."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1590
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_6f8e1b0f:

    # mc "Que la trate como a una empleada me parece lógico. Lo otro, no tanto."
    mc "I think it's logical to treat her like an employee while at work. The other thing, not so much."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1592
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_4b061d2f:

    # lis "Y si como jefa es mala, como madre es de las que están encima permanentemente."
    lis "And if she's a bad boss, she's one of those mothers who's always on top of you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1593
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_bbfccba4:

    # lis "Ella y su padre se mudaron a Atascadero hace unos años y [mad.nick] se quedó aquí. No les sentó bien."
    lis "She and [mad.nick]'s father moved to Atascadero a few years ago, and [mad.nick] stayed here. They didn't like that."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1594
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_8edc108f:

    # lis "Desde entonces está encima de ella permanentemente. Intenta fiscalizar cómo vive, si tiene novio..."
    lis "Since then, she has been constantly on top of her. She tries to control how she lives, whether she has a boyfriend..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1596
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_df7d90bf:

    # mc "Lo que me da a entender que no le ha dicho que estamos juntos."
    mc "Which leads me to believe that she hasn't told her that we're together."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1598
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_5a3493eb:

    # mc "Ni que hay un harén por en medio."
    mc "Nor that there's a harem involved."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1600
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_b14d78a4:

    # lis "Exacto. ¿Te imaginas contarle a alguien así que compartes novio con otras mujeres?"
    lis "Exactly. Can you imagine telling someone like her that she shares her boyfriend with other women?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1602
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_ad103400:

