    mc "*Laugh* I can just picture it. I lived through it when Meemaw found out."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1604
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_152bf4f7:

    # mc "*Risa* Es normal que quiera ocultárselo a su madre si es así."
    mc "*Laugh* It's normal that she wants to hide it from her mother, with a mother like that."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1605
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_945a50b5:

    # lis "No todas las madres son como [mar]."
    lis "Not all mothers are like [mar]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1608
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_3c1a0638:

    # lis "Exacto. Quiere ahorrarse las charlas. No todas las madres son como [mar]."
    lis "Exactly. She wants to skip the lectures. Not all mothers are like [mar]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1609
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_43a9c5db:

    # lis "Si le dice que sale contigo, va a tener que pasar por un interrogatorio."
    lis "If she says she's dating you, you're going to have to go through an interrogation."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1611
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_8ec801d4:

    # mc "Y es normal que [mad.nick] no quiera decirle nada, supongo."
    mc "And it's normal that [mad.nick] doesn't want to tell her anything, I guess."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1613
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_fe35a080:

    # lis "Exacto. Cuanto más encima está de ella, más evita [mad.nick] decirle nada. No todas las madres son como [mar]."
    lis "Exactly. The more she's on top of her, the more [mad.nick] avoids telling her anything. Not all mothers are like [mar]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1615
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_2815e486:

    # lis "Ya sé que no es tu madre, pero es difícil verla de otra manera."
    lis "I know she's not your mother, but it's hard to see her any other way."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1616
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_a5a0c903:

    # mc "La verdad es que tengo mucha suerte."
    mc "The truth is that I am very lucky."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1618
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_b5cfcca3:

    # mc "Hablando de madres... ¿Les has dicho algo a tus padres sobre nosotros?"
    mc "Speaking of mothers... Have you told your parents anything about us?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1620
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_951a1c91:

    # lis "Todavía no. Si lo hiciera, al día siguiente estarían aquí para conocerte. O en el mismo día, si se lo digo por la mañana."
    lis "Not yet. If I did, they'd be here the next day to meet you. Or the same day, if I told them in the morning."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1621
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_b0b7191c:

    # lis "No quiero ponerte en ese compromiso sin antes consultarlo contigo."
    lis "I didn't want to put you in that position without discussing it with you first."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1622
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_4de3387b:

    # mc "Si no te avergüenzas de mí o de nuestra relación, no tengo ningún problema en conocerlos."
    mc "If you're not ashamed of me or our relationship, I have no problem meeting them."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1624
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_7b42a386:

    # mc "Pero quedaría el tema de [deb.nick]. No sé si estarían muy contentos de que salga con sus dos princesas."
    mc "But there would still be the issue of [deb.nick]. I don't know if they would be very happy about me dating both their two princesses."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1626
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_86f99448:

    # lis "*Risa* Creía que la princesa era yo."
    lis "*Laugh* I thought I was the princess?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1627
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_d7ce8473:

    # mc "No sé si las dos sois sus princesas, pero las dos sois las mías."
    mc "I don't know if you two are their princesses, but you are both mine."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1629
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_3bd9dca0:

    # lis "Seguramente si les dijéramos que las dos salimos contigo vendrían igual, pero con las escopetas de caza. *Risa*"
    lis "If we told them that we were both dating you, they would probably come anyway, but with their shotguns. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1630
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_2b3da418:

    # mc "Un enfrentamiento a tiros entre tus padres y [ama] y [eva]... *Risa* Interesante."
    mc "A shootout between your parents and [ama] and [eva]... *Laugh* Interesting."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1632
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_0804bb63:

    # mc "Pero quedaría el tema del harén. No sé si estarían muy contentos de que salgas con alguien que sale con otras mujeres."
    mc "But there would still be the issue of the harem. I don't know if they would be very happy about you dating someone who dates other women."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1634
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_61fddefa:

    # lis "Seguramente si se lo dijera vendrían igual, pero con las escopetas de caza. *Risa*"
    lis "If I told them, they would probably come anyway, but with their shotguns. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1635
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_2b3da418_1:

    # mc "Un enfrentamiento a tiros entre tus padres y [ama] y [eva]... *Risa* Interesante."
    mc "A shootout between your parents and [ama] and [eva]... *Laugh* Interesting."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1637
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_88a51c21:

    # lis "Pero, en serio, no me avergüenzo de nada, con lo que lo tendrán que aceptar. Pero prefiero dejar pasar un tiempo antes de decírselo."
    lis "But seriously, I'm not ashamed of anything, so they'll just have to accept it. But I'd rather let some time pass before I tell them."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1638
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_f8a615ba:

    # lis "Lo de 'Mamá, llevo tres semanas aquí y estoy saliendo con alguien' no quedaría muy bien a los ojos de mis padres."
    lis "The 'Mom, I've been here for three weeks and I'm dating someone' line wouldn't go down too well with my parents."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1639
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_e0425937:

    # mc "Se lo diremos cuando quieras. Cuenta conmigo para ello."
    mc "We'll tell them whenever you want. You can count on me."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1641
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_85e69441:

    # lis "Pienso que, como en el caso de [mad.nick], no tienen que tener voz ni voto en con quien salgo. Soy una adulta y es mi decisión."
    lis "I think that, as in the case of [mad.nick], they don't have a say in who I date. I'm an adult and it's my decision."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1642
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_312796d9:

    # mc "Estoy de acuerdo, pero supongo que quieren cuidar de ti y evitar que cometas errores."
    mc "I agree, but I guess they want to look out for you, and keep you from making mistakes."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1644
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_737cb19d:

    # mad "Ya hemos acabado, chicos. ¿En qué puedo ayudaros?"
    mad "We're done, guys. How can I help you?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1645
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_38896d65:

    # mad "[mc], ven. Quiero presentarte a mi madre, Rose."
    mad "[mc], come here. I want to introduce you to my mother, Rose."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1647
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_8c8a1cab:

    # mc "Encantado de conocerla, Sra. Chang."
    mc "Nice to meet you, Mrs. Chang."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1648
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_e8bf7152:

    # "Sra. Chang" "Igualmente. ¿Eres amigo de mi hija?"
    "Mrs. Chang" "Likewise. Are you friends with my daughter?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1649
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_bf617666:

    # mc "Sí, somos buenos amigos."
    mc "Yes, we're good friends."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1651
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_de7ec540:

    # "Sra. Chang" "Y no tendrás un amigo soltero, ¿verdad? Porque tú estás con [lis], ¿verdad?"
    "Mrs. Chang" "And you don't have any single friends, right? Because you're with [lis], right?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1652
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_71569921:

    # "Sra. Chang" "A este paso, [mad] va a parecer un meme. Llegará a los 30 sola y con su piso lleno de gatos. Ya ha empezado."
    "Mrs. Chang" "At this rate, [mad] is going to look like a meme. She'll end up alone at 30 with an apartment full of cats. She's already started."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1653
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_71b56c4c:

    # "Te cae mal inmediatamente. Sabes que [mad.nick] odia que la llamen [mad] y, pese a todo, su madre usa ese nombre. Te enfadas inmediatamente."
    "You dislike her immediately. You know that [mad.nick] hates being called [mad], and yet her mother uses that name. You get angry right away."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1654
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_219b4e47:

    # "Además, tiene una de esas sonrisas que no llegan a los ojos. Una sonrisa tan falsa como un billete naranja de 100 dólares."
    "What's more, she has one of those smiles that doesn't reach her eyes. A smile as fake as a counterfeit orange $100 bill."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1655
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_c8725dbd:

    # mcp "(¿Quién eres tú para decidir cómo tiene que vivir su vida [mad.nick]?)"
    mcp "(Who are you to decide how [mad.nick] should live her life?)"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1656
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_fd49d41c:

    # mcp "(Si quiere tener diez gatos, ¿qué más da?)"
    mcp "(If she wants to have ten cats, what does it matter?)"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1657
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_cca94157:

    # "Tu enfado evita que pase por tu mente la idea de que, con diez gatos, vas a gastar un montón de dinero en camas."
    "Your anger prevents you from thinking about the fact that, with ten cats, you're going to spend a lot of money on beds."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1658
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_d2df6d5f:

    # mc "Tengo amigos solteros..."
    mc "I have single friends..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1659
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_1530b853:

    # "La sangre empieza a hervirte en las venas. Nunca has podido soportar este tipo de madre, y menos aún con lo que te ha dicho [lis]."
    "Your blood starts boiling in your veins. You've never been able to stand this kind of mother, and even less so after what [lis] told you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1662
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_6ab204f3:

    # "Miras a [mad.nick], que entiende tu pregunta y da su aprobación con un ligero asentimiento."
    "You look at [mad.nick], who understands your question and gives her approval with a slight nod."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1664
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_d92193b9:

    # mc "Pero no se preocupe. No va a llegar sola ni a los 30 ni a los 27."
    mc "But don't worry. She won't be alone at 30 or even at 27."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1668
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_41f36e33:

    # "Rodeas a la diminuta mujer pese a su cara de perplejidad y besas dulcemente a [mad.nick]."
    "You go around the tiny woman despite her puzzled expression and kiss [mad.nick] sweetly."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1669
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_eaf682cd:

    # "Al principio se tensa un poco por la sorpresa, quizás has malinterpretado su asentimiento."
    "At first, she tenses up a little because of the surprise; perhaps you misinterpreted her nod."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1670
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_aa25d2fb:

    # "No tarda en devolverte el beso. Abrazándote con fuerza. Como un náufrago agarrándose a una madera en medio de una tormenta."
    "She quickly returns your kiss. Hugging you tightly. Like a shipwreck survivor clinging to a piece of wood in the middle of a storm."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1672
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_7b9f2754:

    # "Cuando vuelves a mirar a la odiosa mujer, su cara de sorpresa es genuina. Ya no hay falsedad en ella."
    "When you look back at the obnoxious woman, her surprised expression is genuine. There is no longer any falsehood in her."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1673
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_7d6cecab:

    # mc "Va a llegar a los 30, a los 60, o a los 90 conmigo, si ella quiere."
    mc "She'll reach 30, 60, or 90 with me, if she wants to."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1674
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_bb4942ae:

    # "Sra. Chang" "¿Qué? ¿Cuándo? ¿Desde cuándo?"
    "Mrs. Chang" "What? When? Since when?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1675
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_b58a242e:

    # "Sabes que enemistarte con tu futura suegra nada más conocerla no es una buena idea. Pero tienes que dejarle las cosas claras desde el principio."
    "You know that getting on the wrong side of your future mother-in-law when you first meet her is not a good idea. But you have to make things clear from the start."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1676
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_db7d7c16:

    # mc "Si [mad.nick] no se lo ha querido contar, pregúntese por qué."
    mc "If [mad.nick] didn't want to tell you, ask yourself why."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1677
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_fccbb515:

    # mc "Adiós, Sra. Chang. Yo que usted, empezaría a llamar a [mad.nick] por el nombre que ella prefiere."
    mc "Goodbye, Mrs. Chang. If I were you, I would start calling [mad.nick] by the name she prefers."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1679
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_5fa20d9d:

    # mc "Te espero en el café en el que te esperé la primera vez que fuimos a tu piso."
    mc "I'll wait for you at the café where I waited for you the first time we went to your apartment."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1680
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_2aa284cc:

    # "Falta menos de una hora para que cierre la tienda."
    "The store will close in less than an hour."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1681
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_fcab085b:

    # mad "Hasta luego, [mc]."
    mad "See you later, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1685
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_d3295029:

    # "Rodeas a la diminuta mujer pese a su cara de perplejidad y abrazas fuertemente a [mad.nick]."
    "You go around the tiny woman despite her puzzled expression and hug [mad.nick] tightly."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1686
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_ecb4615c:

    # "Su sorpresa no evita que te devuelva el abrazo. Con fuerza. Como un náufrago agarrándose a una madera en medio de una tormenta."
    "Her surprise doesn't stop her from hugging you back. Tightly. Like a shipwreck survivor clinging to a piece of wood in the middle of a storm."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1687
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_e1686f81:

    # mc "*Susurro* No estás sola."
    mc "*Whispering* You are not alone."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1689
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_7b9f2754_1:

    # "Cuando vuelves a mirar a la odiosa mujer, su cara de sorpresa es genuina. Ya no hay falsedad en ella."
    "When you look back at the obnoxious woman, her surprised expression is genuine. There is no longer any falsehood in her."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1690
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_30bafe72:

    # mc "Va a llegar a los 30, a los 60, o a los 90 con una familia que no se mete en cómo vive su vida."
    mc "She's going to reach 30, 60, or 90 with a family of choice that doesn't meddle in how she lives her life."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1691
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_48ffa719:

    # mcp "(Y si por eso entiendes que estamos juntos, es tu problema.)"
    mcp "(And if that makes you think we're together, that's your problem.)"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1692
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_bb4942ae_1:

    # "Sra. Chang" "¿Qué? ¿Cuándo? ¿Desde cuándo?"
    "Mrs. Chang" "What? When? Since when?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1693
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_db7d7c16_1:

    # mc "Si [mad.nick] no se lo ha querido contar, pregúntese por qué."
    mc "If [mad.nick] didn't want to tell you, ask yourself why."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1694
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_fccbb515_1:

    # mc "Adiós, Sra. Chang. Yo que usted, empezaría a llamar a [mad.nick] por el nombre que ella prefiere."
    mc "Goodbye, Mrs. Chang. If I were you, I would start calling [mad.nick] by the name she prefers."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1696
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_1eaba6f4:

    # mc "Te espero para tomar un café en las galerías cuando cierres, [mad.nick]."
    mc "I'll wait for you at the galleries to have a coffee when you close, [mad.nick]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1697
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_2aa284cc_1:

    # "Falta menos de una hora para que cierre la tienda."
    "The store will close in less than an hour."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1698
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_2d9ac33c:

    # mad "Me parece una idea genial, [mc]."
    mad "I think it's a great idea, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1700
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_eeaa46a4:

    # "Te diriges a despedirte de [lis]."
    "You head over to say goodbye to [lis]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1702
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_89ccbad9:

    # "Hay algo en su mirada que te dice que no es buena idea besarla para despedirte."
    "There's something in her eyes that tells you it's not a good idea to kiss her goodbye."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1703
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_883f391b:

    # mc "¿Necesitas que te lleve a casa luego?"
    mc "Do you need a ride home later?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1704
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_4cab6c6e:

    # lis "*Susurrando* No hace falta, gracias. Voy a quedarme aquí hasta que [mad.nick] cierre para evitar que su madre la bombardee a preguntas."
    lis "*Whispering* No need, thanks. I'm going to stay here until [mad.nick] closes so her mother doesn't pepper her with questions."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1706
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_2d45dde2:

    # lis "*Susurrando* Después cogeré un Under para volver a casa y os dejo solos tomando ese café."
    lis "*Whispering* Then I'll take an Under to go home and leave you alone to enjoy your coffee."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1708
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_57f7bd9a:

    # lis "*Susurrando* Después la acompañaré a ese café, si no te importa."
    lis "*Whispering* I'll walk her to the café afterwards, if you don't mind."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1709
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_82347b9c:

    # mc "Para nada. Eres bienvenida a ese café."
    mc "Not at all. You're welcome to join us for coffee."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1711
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_7b54a79b:

    # lis "*Susurrando* ¡Eso ha sido increíble!"
    lis "*Whispering* That was incredible!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1712
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_8deaffbb:

    # "No podías imaginar que [lis] pudiera saltar tanto."
    "You couldn't imagine that [lis] could jump so high."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1713
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_d8907418:

    # lis "*Susurrando* Cómo has dejado a su madre con la boca abierta... No mires, pero sigue con la boca abierta."
    lis "*Whispering* You've left her mother speechless... Don't look, but she's still standing there with her mouth open."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1715
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_e18668d3:

    # lis "*Susurrando* Empiezo a estar un poco menos asustada porque conozcas a mis padres."
    lis "*Whispering* I'm starting to feel a little less scared about you meeting my parents."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1716
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_bdfb1a38:

    # mc "*Susurrando* ¿Estabas asustada por mí? *Risa*"
    mc "*Whispering* Were you scared for me? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1717
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_6223ac9c:

    # lis "*Susurrando* Un poco. Pero ahora empiezo a estar asustada por ellos. *Risa*"
    lis "*Whispering* A little. But now I'm starting to be scared for them. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1719
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_9d61532f:

    # mc "*Risa* Te veo en casa."
    mc "*Laugh* See you at home."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1721
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_ea439639:

    # mc "*Risa* Te veo en el café."
    mc "*Laugh* See you at the café."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1723
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_de647f73:

    # "Te vas de la tienda sin una palabra más. Sintiéndote un como un personaje de una serie policiaca mala ambientada en Miami."
    "You leave the store without another word. Feeling like a character in a bad crime series set in Miami."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1724
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_fd996490:

    # "Sólo te falta ser pelirrojo y tener unas gafas de sol."
    "All you need is red hair and sunglasses."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1725
translate english c27s002_LisShopping_4c5c7d99:

    # "Y una explosión detrás tuyo. Casi esperas escuchar la cabeza de la madre de [mad.nick] explotar en cualquier momento."
    "And an explosion behind you. You almost expect to hear [mad.nick]'s mother's head explode at any moment."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1731
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_1bb26e2a:

    # "Nada más salir de la tienda..."
    "As soon as you leave the store..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1732
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_7dda0259:

    # "*Ring-Ring*"
    "*Ring-Ring*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1734
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_3b5b6806:

    # mc "Hola, [ama]. ¿Algún problema en la universidad?"
    mc "Hello, [ama]. Any problems at college?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1735
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_ef4f1672:

    # ama "Ya he hecho lo de [sim]. Pero hay un problema con lo de [eil]."
    ama "I've already done the [sim] part. But there's a problem with the [eil] part."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1736
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_29714f61:

    # mc "¿Qué ha pasado?"
    mc "What happened?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1738
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_93cc5a15:

    # ama "Alguien ha pagado su matrícula. Se te han adelantado."
    ama "Someone else has already paid for her tuition. They've beaten you to it."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1739
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_087a9f9f:

    # mc "¿Quién ha sido? ¿Lo has podido averiguar?"
    mc "Who was it? Were you able to find out?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1741
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_7f9e2ed4:

    # ama "Me ha atendido Anthony y no me ha querido decir quién lo ha hecho, pero me lo puedo imaginar. [lis] y [deb.nick]."
    ama "Anthony assisted me with the [sim] enrollment, and he did not want to tell me who had done [eil]'s, but I can imagine. [lis] and [deb.nick]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1742
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_06df0aab:

    # mc "Tiene lógica. Hasta ayer eran las únicas a las que les sobraba el dinero para hacerlo."
    mc "It makes sense. Until yesterday, they were the only ones with enough money to do so."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1743
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_c6a16c9b:

    # mc "Me extraña que no hayan hecho lo mismo con [sim]."
    mc "I'm surprised they didn't do the same with [sim]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1745
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_790b0888:

    # ama "Sobre eso, a Anthony se le ha escapado algo. Ha dicho, 'Ellas lo intentaron, pero no teníamos su expediente'."
    ama "Anthony let something slip about that. He said, 'They tried, but we didn't have her file'."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1746
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_21ef7a27:

    # ama "Ese 'Ellas' deja muy claro quiénes son."
    ama "That 'they' makes it crystal clear who he meant."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1747
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_14280410:

    # mc "*Risa* Por suerte no lo consiguieron, o te hubieras quedado sin los pierogis de agradecimiento."
    mc "*Laugh* Luckily they didn't succeed, or you would have been left without your thank-you pierogis."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1749
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_7137c4fb:

    # ama "*Risa* ¡No me hables de pierogis! Se me remueven en el estómago y a la vez tengo una sensación de antojo."
    ama "*Laugh* Don't talk to me about pierogis! They make my stomach churn, but at the same time, I have a craving for them."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1750
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_5c8c93f4:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Sabes que cada vez estoy más orgulloso de todas vosotras?"
    mc "*Laugh* Do you know that I am increasingly proud of all of you?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1752
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_61a8b7ac:

    # ama "¿Por hacer lo que ibas a hacer tú? ¿No te sientes cómo si te hubieran robado la oportunidad de hacer algo por [eil]?"
    ama "For doing what you were going to do? Don't you feel like you've been robbed of the opportunity to do something for [eil]?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1753
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_678d7865:

    # mc "No lo hacía por 'hacer algo por ella'. El objetivo era que ella volviera a estudiar, no que nadie me lo agradeciera."
    mc "I wasn't doing it to 'do something for her'. The goal was for her to go back to her studies, not for anyone to thank me."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1754
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_3d693cf9:

    # mc "Da lo mismo si el objetivo se ha cumplido gracias a las hermanas o a mí. Lo importante es que [eil] va a poder volver a la universidad."
    mc "It doesn't matter whether the goal was achieved thanks to the Selden sisters or to me. The key point is that [eil] will be able to return to college."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1756
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_f1f6e6e7:

    # ama "Al menos, a ti no te engordarán con una tonelada de pierogis."
    ama "At least you won't be fattened up with a ton of pierogis."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1757
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_8ae1333a:

    # mc "Tienes que aprender que incluso a [sam.nick] le puedes decir que no quieres más."
    mc "You have to learn that you can tell even [sam.nick] that you don't want any more food."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1759
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_8c8535bb:

    # ama "Pero estaban tan buenos..."
    ama "But they were so good..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1760
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_cbf18df4:

    # mc "Y es agradable sentir el agradecimiento, ¿verdad?"
    mc "And it's nice to feel the gratitude, isn't it?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1762
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_1d834f65:

    # ama "Es una pasada. No por el agradecimiento en sí, sino por lo bien que me estaba sintiendo yo por haber pensado en una forma de ayudar."
    ama "It's amazing. Not because of the gratitude itself, but because of how good I felt for having thought of a way to help."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1763
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_1308f261:

    # ama "Ver la alegría de [sim] porque por fin va a poder ir a la universidad ha sido increíble."
    ama "Seeing [sim]'s joy at finally being able to go to college was incredibly rewarding."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1764
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_fbe1e849:

    # ama "Saber que la idea que ha propiciado esa alegría ha sido mía... No sé... Produce una sensación de calor en el estómago."
    ama "Knowing that the idea that brought that joy was mine... I don't know... It makes me feel warm inside."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1765
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_24ef719a:

    # mc "*Risa* ¡Eso eran los pierogis!"
    mc "*Laugh* That was the pierogis!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1767
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_7b8555d9:

    # ama "*Risa* ¡Capullo! ¡No voy a comer en dos días!"
    ama "*Laugh* You jerk! I'm not going to eat for two days!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1768
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_d2e0dce1:

    # mc "¿No vienes a cenar a casa hoy?"
    mc "Aren't you coming over for dinner tonight?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1769
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_4dbefcfe:

    # ama "*Risa* Sí. Por eso no he dicho en qué dos días. Seguramente me ponga a dieta cuando lleguemos a Aruba."
    ama "*Laugh* Yes. That's why I didn't say which two days. I'll probably go on a diet when we get to Aruba."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1770
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_f6149705:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Entiendes ahora por qué estaba gordo?"
    mc "*Laugh* Do you understand now why I was fat?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1772
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_cfacdf2c:

    # ama "Lo que no entiendo es cómo no te deprimiste cuando fuiste a Portland y tuviste que dejar de comer los platos de [mar], [nor], y [sam.nick]."
    ama "What I don't understand is how you didn't get depressed when you went to Portland and had to stop eating [mar], [nor], and [sam.nick]'s dishes."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1773
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_27082def:

    # mc "*Risa* Busqué un jefe que era un gourmet. Comer con él varios días por semana sirvió como sustituto."
    mc "*Laugh* I looked for a boss who was a gourmet. Eating with him several days a week served as a substitute."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1775
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_f9d36ec2:

    # ama "Bueno, [mc]. Te voy a dejar. Quiero ir a la base a ducharme antes de ir a casa a cenar. ¿Te veo luego?"
    ama "Okay, [mc]. I'm going to have to go. I want to go to the base to shower before going home for dinner. See you later?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1777
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_29bccd48:

    # mc "No lo sé. Acabo de salir de la tienda de [mad.nick] y he tenido un encontronazo con su madre."
    mc "I don't know. I just left [mad.nick]'s store and had a confrontation with her mother."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1778
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_dd8fe5c9:

    # mc "Le he dicho que esperaré a que cierre para tomar un café. No sé qué haremos luego."
    mc "I told her I'd wait until she closed to have a coffee. I don't know what we'll do after that."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1780
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_b2f6b87d:

    # ama "Vete a cenar con ella. Por lo que he oído, la madre es una bruja y seguro que [mad.nick] necesita un poco de apoyo."
    ama "Go out to dinner with her. From what I heard, her mother is a witch, and [mad.nick] surely needs some support."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1781
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_409b418b:

    # ama "O tráela a cenar a casa y le damos apoyo todas."
    ama "Or bring her over for dinner at home, and we'll all support her."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1782
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_a7082e58:

    # mc "Mi idea era ir a cenar. Hace días que no hemos tenido tiempo a solas y..."
    mc "My idea was to go out for dinner. We haven't had any time alone together for several days and. . ."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1784
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_ff878bcc:

    # ama "Hazlo. Le diré a [mar] que no vienes ni a cenar ni a dormir."
    ama "Do it. I'll tell [mar] that you're not coming home for dinner or to sleep."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1785
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_9834909d:

    # mc "Yo no he dicho nada de no ir a dormir."
    mc "I didn't say anything about not going to sleep."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1787
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_82471ece:

    # ama "Bueno, esta vez soy yo la que toma la decisión por ti. ¿Cómo sienta cuando se cambian las tornas?"
    ama "Well, this time I'm the one making the choice for you. How does it feel when the tables are turned?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1788
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_c1cd5e10:

    # mc "*Risa* Sienta genial. Te veo mañana, [ama]."
    mc "*Laugh* It feels great. See you tomorrow, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1789
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_185999e3:

    # ama "Te veo mañana. Pasáoslo bien."
    ama "See you tomorrow. Have a good time."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1791
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_be5f40e8:

    # mc "Sí. Acabo de salir de la tienda de [mad.nick] y he tenido un encontronazo con su madre."
    mc "Yes. I just left [mad.nick]'s store and had a confrontation with her mother."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1792
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_c824ab6a:

    # mc "Le he dicho que esperaré a que cierre para tomar un café. Después iré a casa."
    mc "I told her I'd wait until she closed to have a coffee. Then I'll go home."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1794
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_a0692074:

    # ama "Parece una buena idea. Por lo que he oído, la madre es una bruja y seguro que [mad.nick] necesita un poco de apoyo."
    ama "Sounds like a good idea. From what I've heard, the mother is a witch, and I'm sure [mad.nick] could use some support."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1795
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_409b418b_1:

    # ama "O tráela a cenar a casa y le damos apoyo todas."
    ama "Bring her over for dinner at home, and we'll all support her."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1796
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_d2a4b3c3:

    # mc "Se lo propondré, a ver qué le parece. Te veo luego."
    mc "I'll suggest it to her and see what she thinks. See you later."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1797
translate english c27s002_AmaAtCollege2_fb8c89e8:

    # ama "Hasta luego, [mc]."
    ama "See you later, [mc]."

