    "[lis] also wants her kiss. She kisses you as soon as the shop clerk sits down."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1857
translate english c27s003_MadLis_802dc70a:

    # "[lis] te besa en cuanto la dependienta se sienta."
    "[lis] kisses you as soon as the shop clerk sits down."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1859
translate english c27s003_MadLis_bf79a8ee:

    # lis "Puedo convertirme en una Karen en cualquier momento, y ese ha sido el momento perfecto."
    lis "I can become a Karen at any moment, and that was the perfect occasion."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1860
translate english c27s003_MadLis_063b558b:

    # lis "*Risa* Mi faceta de clienta odiosa que quiere que le enseñen todo puede ser muy útil."
    lis "*Laugh* My side as an annoying customer who wants to be shown everything can be very useful."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1861
translate english c27s003_MadLis_0dd65c5f:

    # mc "*Risa* Y como la jefa ya estaba ahí, no podías pedir hablar con ella."
    mc "*Laugh* And since the manager was already there, you couldn't ask to talk with her."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1863
translate english c27s003_MadLis_8f7d65e4:

    # lis "Exacto, aparta y déjame sitio."
    lis "Exactly, move aside and make some room for me."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1864
translate english c27s003_MadLis_b8721c04:

    # mc "Lo hago porque te lo has ganado. *Risa*"
    mc "I'm doing it because you've earned it. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1866
translate english c27s003_MadLis_3ca18231:

    # mad "La verdad es que hacía mucho que no veía a mi madre tan sorprendida. Normalmente todo el mundo hace lo que ella quiere."
    mad "The truth is that it had been a long time since I saw my mother so surprised. Usually, everyone does what she wants."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1868
translate english c27s003_MadLis_84f12b5c:

    # mc "Pues creo que, si alguna vez me invita a una reunión familiar, no voy a ser su yerno favorito."
    mc "Well, I think that if she ever invites me to a family gathering, I won't be her favorite son-in-law."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1870
translate english c27s003_MadLis_00cb27fe:

    # mc "Pues creo que ha encontrado un rival en mí."
    mc "Well, I think she has found a rival in me."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1871
translate english c27s003_MadLis_bca0b992:

    # mc "No me estaba gustando cómo estaba hablando de ti con un tipo al que acaba de conocer. Ni que te llamara [mad], sabiendo lo poco que te gusta."
    mc "I didn't like how she was talking about you with a guy she just met. Or that she called you [mad], knowing how much you dislike it."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1873
translate english c27s003_MadLis_80683035:

    # mad "Lo de [mad] nunca me ha gustado, pero lo entiendo. Es el nombre con el que ella siempre ha pensado en mí."
    mad "I've never liked [mad], but I understand it. It's the name she's always thought of me by."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1874
translate english c27s003_MadLis_2bb432be:

    # mad "Pero no me gusta que quiera avergonzarme con lo de acabar siendo una solterona que acaba sola con la casa llena de gatos."
    mad "But I don't like that she wants to embarrass me by saying I'll end up an old single woman living alone with a house full of cats."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1876
translate english c27s003_MadLis_a08a2d9a:

    # mc "Bueno, no vas a ser una solterona ni a estar sola. Y lo de los gatos... Si alguna vez tienes más de uno..."
    mc "Well, you're not going to be a spinster or be alone. And as for cats... If you ever have more than one..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1878
translate english c27s003_MadLis_d90d66e2:

    # mc "Bueno, no vas a estar sola. Y lo de los gatos... Si alguna vez tienes más de uno..."
    mc "Well, you won't be alone. And as for cats... If you ever have more than one..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1880
translate english c27s003_MadLis_19da3e06:

    # lis "Evitaremos que entren en tu habitación. *Risa* Espero que esa cama dure mucho."
    lis "We'll keep them out of your room. *Laugh* I hope that bed lasts a long time."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1881
translate english c27s003_MadLis_621dd6f9:

    # lis "La próxima vez tenemos que sustituir a Zeus por [mad.nick]."
    lis "Next time, we need to replace Zeus with [mad.nick]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1882
translate english c27s003_MadLis_b92bee6f:

    # mc "*Risa* Podemos poner una lata de una tonelada de atún al lado de la piscina para evitar que se mueva de ahí."
    mc "*Laugh* We can put a one-ton can of tuna next to the pool to keep him from moving from there."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1884
translate english c27s003_MadLis_64785b21:

    # mad "No os metáis con el pobre Zeus. Suficiente tiene con llevar dos días en el veterinario."
    mad "Don't pick on poor Zeus. He's had enough with spending two days at the vet."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1885
translate english c27s003_MadLis_bc09297b:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Qué le pasa?"
    mc "What? What's wrong with him?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1887
translate english c27s003_MadLis_b5bbce20:

    # mad "Algunas de las chicas le dieron de comer más de lo debido y se ha puesto enfermo."
    mad "Some of the girls fed him more than he should have eaten, and he has become sick."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1888
translate english c27s003_MadLis_2b4af40a:

    # mad "Como, a pesar de eso, sigue siendo un comilón, el veterinario me sugirió que lo dejara allí, donde lo pueden controlar mejor."
    mad "Since he is still a glutton despite that, the vet suggested that I leave him there, where they can monitor him better."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1890
translate english c27s003_MadLis_4c1b6750:

    # mad "Me paso el día fuera de casa y no podría controlar si abre algún armario para coger comida."
    mad "I spend the day away from home and wouldn't be able to control whether he opens any cupboards to get food."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1891
translate english c27s003_MadLis_abc95beb:

    # mc "*Risa* Deberías poner candados en todas las puertas donde haya comida."
    mc "*Laugh* You should put locks on all the cupboards where food is kept."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1892
translate english c27s003_MadLis_92574c69:

    # mc "Aunque visto lo listo que es, sería capaz de aprender a usar una ganzúa."
    mc "Although, given how clever he is, he would be capable of learning how to use a lock pick."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1894
translate english c27s003_MadLis_938f9629:

    # lis "[mad.nick], te aseguro que yo sólo le di un trozo pequeño de bacon."
    lis "[mad.nick], I promise I only gave him a small piece of bacon."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1895
translate english c27s003_MadLis_3c14d331:

    # mc "Creo que el problema es que tú le diste bacon, [nor] salchichas, [dap] jamón, [eil] una lata de atún, [eri] varias latas..."
    mc "I think the problem is that you gave him bacon, [nor] sausages, [dap] ham, [eil] a can of tuna, [eri] several cans... and so on."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1896
translate english c27s003_MadLis_08f64b1c:

    # mc "La próxima vez os deberíais poner de acuerdo en quién le da qué."
    mc "Next time, you should keep a record of who is giving what to Zeus. That way, you won't overfeed him."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1898
translate english c27s003_MadLis_47650983:

    # mad "Bueno, creo que lo que ha pasado nos servirá de lección a todos. Zeus incluido. Ha aprendido que, si come mucho, se pone malo."
    mad "Well, I think what happened will serve as a lesson to all of us, including Zeus. He has learned that if he eats too much, he gets sick."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1899
translate english c27s003_MadLis_fd9b3788:

    # mad "Solo faltará que lo recuerde la próxima vez que tenga comida delante."
    mad "All that's left is for him to remember it the next time he has food in front of him."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1900
translate english c27s003_MadLis_fbd300d8:

    # mc "Eso va a ser más difícil. Pese a que parece bastante listo, me da la impresión de que, cuando hay comida por en medio, no piensa demasiado."
    mc "That's going to be more difficult. Although he seems quite smart, I get the impression that when food is involved, he doesn't think too much."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1903
translate english c27s003_MadLis_a861bcf7:

    # lis "Bueno, parejita, yo os voy a dejar y voy a volver a casa."
    lis "Well, lovebirds, I'm going to leave you now and go home."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1904
translate english c27s003_MadLis_3ecea66a:

    # mc "¿Al final no has comprado nada? No veo bolsas..."
    mc "Did you end up not buying anything? I don't see any bags..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1906
translate english c27s003_MadLis_97038187:

    # lis "Sí que he comprado, pero [mad.nick] lo enviará a casa. No quería ir cargada en el Under."
    lis "Yes, I did buy some clothes, but [mad.nick] will send them home. I didn't want to carry too many bags on the Under."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1907
translate english c27s003_MadLis_89b0a1b8:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Tanto has comprado?"
    mc "*Laugh* Did you buy that much?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1909
translate english c27s003_MadLis_41fa6133:

    # mad "No lo quieras saber. *Risa* Creo que [lis] se ha convertido en una de mis mejores clientas en estas semanas."
    mad "You don't want to know. *Laugh* I think [lis] has become one of my best customers in the last few weeks."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1910
translate english c27s003_MadLis_fc692fce:

    # mc "*Risa* Al final va a tener que echar a [deb.nick] de la habitación para meter toda la ropa."
    mc "*Laugh* In the end, you're going to have to kick [deb.nick] out of your room to fit all your clothes in."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1914
translate english c27s003_MadLis_a85e51db:

    # lis "No hace falta echarla. *Risa* Con ocupar sus armarios tengo suficiente."
    lis "There's no need to kick her out. *Laugh* Just occupying her closets is enough for me."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1915
translate english c27s003_MadLis_4dea7428:

    # lis "Te veo en casa, [mc]. Hasta mañana, [mad.nick]."
    lis "See you at home, [mc]. See you tomorrow, [mad.nick]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:1918
translate english c27s003_MadLis_f6134b6e:

    # lis "¿No le vas a contar a [mc] la gran noticia, [mad.nick]?"
    lis "Aren't you going to tell [mc] the big news, [mad.nick]?"

