# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2940
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_82c1f004:

    # mc "*Risa* En ese caso, sería mejor para tus planes que [ama] y [eva] durmieran en la base."
    mc "*Laugh* In that case, it would be better for your plans if [ama] and [eva] slept on the base."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2943
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_c59bd940:

    # mee "*Risa* Seguro que sí. Lo de decirles 'vete a dormir al sofá porque mi nieto y yo vamos a follar en tu cama' no parece diplomático."
    mee "*Laugh* I'm sure it would. Telling them, 'Go sleep on the couch because my grandson and I are going to have sex in your bed,' doesn't seem very diplomatic."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2945
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_916a31d2:

    # mee "*Risa* Seguro que sí. Lo de decirles 'vete a dormir al sofá porque [mc] y yo vamos a follar en tu cama' no parece diplomático."
    mee "*Laugh* I'm sure it would. Telling them, 'Go sleep on the couch because [mc] and I are going to have sex in your bed,' doesn't seem very diplomatic."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2947
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_b76347d2:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que no lo sería. Además podría pasar que se quisieran unir, aunque en el caso de [ama] lo dudo."
    mc "*Laugh* I don't think it would be. Besides, they might want to join in, although in the case of [ama], I doubt it."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2948
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_c044b689:

    # mc "Pero no me sorprendería que [eva] quisiera estrechar lazos contigo con un trío."
    mc "But I wouldn't be surprised if [eva] wanted to strengthen her bond with you with a threesome."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2950
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_6fbad351:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que no lo sería. Además podría pasar que [ama] uniera, aunque lo dudo."
    mc "*Laugh* I don't think it would be. It could also happen that [ama] would join, although I doubt it."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2952
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_ebb9d771:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que no lo sería. Además podría pasar que [eva] se quisiera unir. No me sorprendería que quisiera estrechar lazos contigo con un trío."
    mc "*Laugh* I don't think it would be. Besides, [eva] might want to join in. I wouldn't be surprised if she wanted to strengthen her bond with you with a threesome."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2954
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_2850f646:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que no lo sería."
    mc "*Laugh* I don't think it would be."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2955
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_25c265ea:

    # mc "Pero podemos probar todas las camas no ocupadas."
    mc "But we can try out all the unoccupied beds."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2958
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_be8d3267:

    # "Tu abuela te da un beso como pocos nietos han recibido de sus abuelas."
    "Your grandmother gives you a kiss like few grandchildren have ever received from their grandmothers."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2960
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_cae9380c:

    # "[mee] te da un beso como pocos nietos han recibido de sus abuelas. Da lo mismo que no estéis emparentados. Siempre será tu abuela."
    "[mee] gives you a kiss like few grandchildren have ever received from their grandmothers. It doesn't matter that you're not related. She will always be your grandmother."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2961
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_f42214e9:

    # "Es un beso que sabe a despedida."
    "It's a kiss that tastes like goodbye."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2963
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_afc77b99:

    # mee "Deberías bajar la maleta e ir a ver a [bet]. Es posible que ella también necesite ayuda."
    mee "You should bring down the suitcase and go see [bet]. She may need help, too."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2964
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_36c3f932:

    # mee "Y no quiero alargar nuestra despedida más de lo necesario o me voy a poner triste antes de irme."
    mee "And I don't want to prolong our farewell any longer than necessary, or I'll get sad before I leave."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2965
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_8231049d:

    # mc "De acuerdo. Y no te pongas triste. Nos veremos en menos de una semana."
    mc "Okay. And don't be sad. We'll see each other in less than a week."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2967
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_b511dc15:

    # mee "Hasta dentro de una semana, [mc]."
    mee "See you in a week, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2968
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_d4b33b85:

    # mc "Hasta dentro de una semana, Meemaw."
    mc "See you in a week, Meemaw."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2971
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_a302fc1a:

    # "Bajas la maleta de [mee] a la planta baja y vas a ver a [bet]."
    "You take [mee]'s suitcase downstairs and go to see [bet]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2972
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_c6a7df6d:

    # mc "Hola, Tía [bet]. ¿Necesitas ayuda con las maletas?"
    mc "Hi, Aunt [bet]. Do you need help with the suitcases?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2973
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_67d948a9:

    # bet "No hace falta. Era solo una y la he bajado hace un rato. Ya está en el coche de [nor]."
    bet "No need. It was just one, and I brought it down a little while ago. It's already in [nor]'s car."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2974
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_feda2bd5:

    # mc "Perfecto, acabo de bajar la de Meemaw. Dejo que te acabes de vestir, entonces."
    mc "Perfect, I just brought Meemaw's downstairs. I'll let you finish getting dressed, then."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2976
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_71b37506:

    # bet "Te voy a echar mucho de menos."
    bet "I'm going to miss you so much."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2977
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_94a17613:

    # mc "Y yo a ti, pero Meemaw me ha dicho que estaréis fuera menos de una semana."
    mc "And I will miss you too, but Meemaw told me you'll be away for less than a week."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2978
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_221f7234:

    # mc "Y después espero que vengas a Aruba conmigo para operar a Gavin."
    mc "And then I hope you'll come to Aruba with me to perform the surgery on Gavin."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2980
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_2fd3634b:

    # bet "Aún tengo que acabar de estudiar la información que me ha mandado Aaron, pero creo que iré finalmente."
    bet "I still have to finish studying the information Aaron sent me, but I think I'll go after all."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2981
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_8603f6b3:

    # bet "La perspectiva de hacer una operación que no se ha hecho nunca es el sueño de cualquier cirujano."
    bet "The prospect of performing a surgery that has never been done before is every surgeon's dream."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2982
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_d91b64eb:

    # mc "Entonces no tendrás mucho tiempo para echarme de menos."
    mc "Then you won't have much time to miss me."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2984
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_427bd3f8:

    # bet "Pero entonces echaré de menos a todas las chicas. Incluso a [mee]."
    bet "But then I'll miss all the girls. Even [mee]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2985
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_5f0efc15:

    # mc "Sobre eso no puedo hacer mucho. Yo también las voy a echar de menos."
    mc "There's not much I can do about that. I'm going to miss them too."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2988
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_9500ecfc:

    # bet "Bueno, vete ya antes de que se me salten las lágrimas. Tengo que acabar de vestirme."
    bet "Well, go now before I start crying. I have to finish getting dressed."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2989
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_28ab7de5:

    # mc "OK. Te veo abajo."
    mc "OK. I'll see you downstairs."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2992
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_a0b4fbbe:

    # "Al pasar por delante de la puerta de [mee] oyes voces en el interior."
    "As you walk past the door of [mee], you hear voices inside."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2993
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_b3a82761:

    # mee "*A través de la puerta* Hola, [mad.nick], dime..."
    mee "*Through the door* Hello, [mad.nick], talk to me..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2996
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_9553287f:

    # bet "Por otro lado, tengo ganas de estar tiempo a solas contigo en Aruba."
    bet "On the other hand, I'm looking forward to spending time alone with you in Aruba."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2997
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_be5410f6:

    # mc "No sé si vamos a tener mucho tiempo libre, pero lo pasaremos juntos."
    mc "I don't know if we'll have much free time, but we'll spend it together."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:2999
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_08ca220d:

    # bet "*Risa* Si hacer esa operación imposible no fuera incentivo suficiente para ir, pasar tiempo contigo en un paraíso tropical sería un aliciente extra."
    bet "*Laugh* If performing that impossible operation wasn't enough incentive to go, spending time with you in a tropical paradise would be an added bonus."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3000
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_0cc2bfc0:

    # mc "*Risa* A mí lo del paraíso tropical no me suena demasiado bien. Calor, humedad, mosquitos..."
    mc "*Laugh* The tropical paradise thing doesn't sound too good to me. Heat, humidity, mosquitoes..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3002
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_c78f41a4:

    # bet "*Risa* Entonces haremos el amor dentro de tu casa, bajo el aire acondicionado."
    bet "*Laugh* Then we'll make love inside your house, under the air conditioning."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3003
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_10a004f4:

    # mc "*Risa* Me parece una idea fantástica."
    mc "*Laugh* I think it's a fantastic idea."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3005
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_e19ccd08:

    # "La ex-monja te da un beso dulce en el que hay anticipación, pero también algo de tristeza por el tiempo que vais a pasar separados."
    "The former nun gives you a sweet kiss filled with anticipation, but also a touch of sadness for the time you will spend apart."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3006
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_d6b3a35e:

    # "No habéis tenido muchas oportunidades de pasar tiempo juntos desde el viaje a Monterey y ahora ella se tiene que ir."
    "You haven't had many opportunities to spend time together since the trip to Monterey, and now she has to leave."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3007
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_e170e6ec:

    # "Aún no sabes cuánto tiempo estará ella en Aruba para la operación, lo que sabes es que lo vais a aprovechar."
    "You still don't know how long she will be in Aruba for the surgery, but what you do know is that you are going to make the most of it."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3009
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_57ef5208:

    # bet "Deberías irte antes de que te tumbe en la cama o perderé el avión."
    bet "You should leave before I lay you down on the bed, or I'll miss my flight."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3010
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_6d28a58f:

    # mc "*Risa* Entonces voy a dejar que te vistas. Te veo abajo, [bet]."
    mc "*Laugh* Then I'll let you get dressed. I'll see you downstairs, [bet]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3013
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_7dda0259:

    # "*Ring-Ring*"
    "*Ring-Ring*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3014
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_a7399e02:

    # "Mientras te diriges a la puerta de su habitación, suena el teléfono de [bet]."
    "As you head toward her bedroom door, [bet]'s phone rings."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3015
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_81c9703e:

    # bet "Hola, [mad.nick], dime..."
    bet "Hello, [mad.nick], talk to me..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3017
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_4371cdd5:

    # mcp "(Estoy super contento con las dinámicas que se están creando en la familia. Que [mad.nick] llame para despedirse es una muestra de ello.)"
    mcp "(I am very pleased with the dynamics that are developing within the family. The fact that [mad.nick] calls to say goodbye is proof of that.)"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3019
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_46b5b83d:

    # "Bajas a la cocina a esperar a que las mujeres acaben de arreglarse y con la esperanza de poder preguntarle a [nor] o a [kim] sobre lo que le pasa a [kat]."
    "You go down to the kitchen to wait for the women to finish getting ready, hoping to ask [nor] or [kim] what's wrong with [kat]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3021
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_fe049a43:

    # "Por desgracia, preguntarles sobre [kat] con [kat] delante no es una opción."
    "Unfortunately, asking them about [kat] with [kat] standing next to them is not an option."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3022
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_96b1bfb2:

    # "Menos aún cuando [kat] rehúye tu mirada. Cada vez estás seguro de que le pasa algo."
    "Even less so when [kat] avoids your gaze. You are increasingly certain that something is wrong with her."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3024
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_c2cf213b:

    # "La despedida de las dos mujeres es demasiado triste."
    "The two women's farewell is too sad."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3025
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_62fce943:

    # "Es la primera vez desde que se empezó a formar el sentimiento familiar que alguien va a estar fuera durante una semana."
    "This is the first time since the family bond began to form that someone will be away for a week."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3026
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_939927ea:

    # "Se derraman algunas lágrimas, pero las chicas me han pedido que no diga quién lloró. Especialmente [eva]."
    "There are a few tears, but the girls asked me not to say who cried. Especially [eva]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3027
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_3691ba7a:

    # "¡Oops! Me parezco a [lis] guardando secretos."
    "Oops! I'm just like [lis] at keeping secrets."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3029
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_8416b25b:

    # "Cuando se van, tampoco tienes la oportunidad de hablar con [kim]. Vuelve a casa charlando con [kat]."
    "When they leave, you don't get a chance to talk to [kim] either. She returns home chatting with [kat]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3030
translate english c27s004_MeeBetFarewell_9c1c8d5a:

    # "Bueno, habrá tiempo para hablar. O incluso es posible que a [kat] se le pase lo que sea que le está pasando."
    "Well, there will be time to talk. Or maybe whatever is going on with [kat] will eventually pass."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3036
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_7149bc57:

    # "Ayudas a [emm] a mover los trastos del sótano. Ha hecho un buen trabajo con las pegatinas rosas."
    "You help [emm] move the junk out of the basement. She did a good job with the pink stickers."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3037
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_0c33a256:

    # "Todos los trastos que hay que tirar son fácilmente identificables."
    "All the junk that needs to be thrown away is easily identifiable."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3038
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_1d1831fd:

    # "[emm] derrama algunas lágrimas cuando ve todas las pegatinas que ha perdido una vez subes las cosas a la camioneta."
    "[emm] sheds a few tears when she sees all the stickers she has lost once you load everything into the pickup truck."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3039
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_a7d3ec7e:

    # "Ha intentado recuperar las pegatinas sin éxito."
    "She tried to retrieve the stickers without success."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3040
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_e1793bd0:

    # "[oma] aprovecha su día de fiesta para ayudarte a llevar los trastos al chatarrero antes de comer."
    "[oma] takes advantage of her day off to help you take the junk to the scrapyard before lunch."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3042
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_732888d7:

    # "Después de comer las chicas van a la piscina y tú vuelves a tu habitación..."
    "After lunch, the girls go to the pool and you go back to your room..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3043
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3044
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_941004dc:

    # eri "*A través de la puerta* Somos nosotras, ¿podemos pasar?"
    eri "*Through the door* It's us, can we come in?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3045
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_157376e5:

    # mc "Adelante, tú y tu silenciosa compañera."
    mc "Come in, you and your quiet companion."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3047
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_9dbded77:

    # eri "*Risa* Mi silenciosa compañera es [sca]."
    eri "*Laugh* My quiet companion is [sca]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3048
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_14ba5775:

    # sca "Hola, [mc]."
    sca "Hi, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3049
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_83848b48:

    # mc "¿Te pasa algo, [sca]?"
    mc "Are you OK, [sca]?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3051
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_c819908b:

    # eri "Está nerviosa. [eil] me acaba de llamar para decirme que nuestro jefe quiere conocer a [sca]."
    eri "She's nervous. [eil] just called me to say that our boss wants to meet [sca]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3052
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_3af951a3:

    # eri "Ayer le hablamos de ella y hoy se pasará por el café. ¿Nos puedes llevar?"
    eri "We told him about her yesterday, and he's coming by the café today. Can you give us a ride?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3053
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_fb875d3b:

    # mc "Claro, ningún problema. ¿Cuándo os tengo que llevar?"
    mc "Sure, no problem. When do you want to leave?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3055
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_264982e2:

    # eri "Yo empiezo mi turno en 50 minutos. Si nos llevas a las dos, [sca] puede esperar allí hasta que llegue mi jefe."
    eri "My shift starts in 50 minutes. If you take us both, [sca] can wait there until my boss arrives."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3056
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_e3c40d2c:

    # mc "OK. Podríamos salir en 30 minutos y llegamos con tiempo antes de que empieces el turno."
    mc "OK. We could leave in 30 minutes and arrive in time before you start your shift."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3058
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_cf1a89a2:

    # mc "No estés nerviosa, es sólo una entrevista de trabajo."
    mc "Don't be nervous, it's just a job interview."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3059
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_6939201a:

    # sca "Es que va a ser mi primera entrevista. Mi madre no me dejaba trabajar, decía que me tenía que centrar en los estudios."
    sca "It's going to be my first job interview. My mother wouldn't let me work; she said I had to focus on my studies."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3060
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_19f45738:

    # mc "Eres lo suficientemente inteligente como para hacer las dos cosas, [sca]."
    mc "You're smart enough to do both things, [sca]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3061
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_a90a0a92:

    # mc "Además, estoy seguro de que tanto [eri] como [eil] te han dado consejos."
    mc "Moreover, I am sure that both [eri] and [eil] have given you advice."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3063
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_96554d74:

    # eri "Básicamente que se convierta en nuestra esclava mientras esté en el café. *Risa* Es broma."
    eri "Basically, she'll become our slave while she's working at the café. *Laugh* Just kidding."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3064
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_3c01bec4:

    # eri "Mi jefe no es muy exigente y ella viene recomendada por nosotras, con lo que tiene muchas posibilidades de que la contrate."
    eri "My boss isn't very demanding, and she comes recommended by us, so there's a good chance he'll hire her."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3066
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_00b08729:

    # eri "Y una vez empiece a trabajar, [eil] y yo moveremos nuestros turnos para que una de las dos esté con ella cada día al menos las primeras semanas."
    eri "And once she starts working, [eil] and I will switch our shifts so that one of us can be with her every day, at least for the first few weeks."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3067
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_73c8887a:

    # mc "Estoy seguro de que eso la ayudará mucho."
    mc "I'm sure that will help her a lot."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3069
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_8b833349:

    # mc "¿Ves? No tienes que estar nerviosa. [eri] y [eil] lo tienen todo planificado."
    mc "See? You don't have to be nervous. [eri] and [eil] have everything planned out."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3070
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_acb4c634:

    # sca "Pero es que ya me conocéis. Soy tímida y me cuesta mucho hablar con desconocidos..."
    sca "But you know me. I'm shy and I find it very difficult to talk to strangers..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3071
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_d45826f5:

    # sca "¿Y si empiezo a balbucear en la entrevista? ¿Y si me quedo en blanco?"
    sca "What if I start stuttering during the interview? What if my mind goes blank?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3072
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_99735a43:

    # mc "¿Y si se te escapa un eructo durante la entrevista?"
    mc "What if you burp during the interview?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3074
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_92dacd4e:

    # sca "¿Qué?"
    sca "What?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3075
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_42f09261:

    # mc "Te estás poniendo nerviosa pensando en todo lo que puede salir mal. *Risa* Yo solo te doy un escenario nuevo en el que no habías pensado."
    mc "You're getting nervous thinking about everything that could go wrong. *Laugh* I'm just giving you a new scenario you hadn't thought of."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3077
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_b5c01fcd:

    # sca "¡Eres un capullo! ¡Eso no ayuda!"
    sca "You're a jerk! That doesn't help!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3078
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_07f595b1:

    # mc "Sí que ayuda. *Risa* La [sca] tímida de hace un mes nunca me hubiera llamado capullo."
    mc "Yes, it helps. *Laugh* The shy [sca] from a month ago would never have called me a jerk."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3079
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_40ebeab9:

    # mc "Ya no eres la que eras. Desde que llegaron las chicas te has abierto mucho y has perdido la timidez. No tienes que temer nada en la entrevista."
    mc "You're not the same person you used to be. Since the girls arrived, you've opened up a lot and lost part of your shyness. You have nothing to fear in the interview."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3081
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_58df713d:

    # eri "¿Ves cómo hemos hecho bien en venir a ver a [mc]? Sabía que te quitaría los nervios."
    eri "See how good it was that we came to see [mc]? I knew he'd calm your nerves."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3082
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_15e80be3:

    # mc "Veo que no vas con el uniforme. ¿Hablaste con tu jefe respecto a la taquillas de [eil]?"
    mc "I see you're not wearing your uniform. Did you talk to your boss about [eil] locker?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3084
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_8c090681:

    # eri "Sí, y fue la cosa más tonta del mundo. Él creía que ya compartíamos taquilla porque somos amigas."
    eri "Yes, and it was the silliest thing in the world. He thought we already shared a locker because we're friends."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3085
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_c7700068:

    # eri "Dijo que todo el mundo lo hace..."
    eri "He said that everyone does it..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3086
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_b8183412:

    # mc "*Risa* Todo el mundo lo pensó menos vosotras. Sois demasiado legales."
    mc "*Laugh* Everyone except you two. You're too lawful."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3088
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_91b2843c:

    # sca "Pues voy a cambiarme de ropa para la entrevista. No creo que ir así sea lo mejor..."
    sca "Well, I'm going to change my clothes for the interview. I don't think going like this is the best idea..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3089
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_069acffe:

    # mc "Nope. En eso tienes razón. *Risa* Aunque yo te contrataría."
    mc "Nope. You're right about that. *Laugh* Although I would hire you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3091
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_bb6d2873:

    # "Las dos chicas se van y te dejan solo en la habitación."
    "The two girls leave you alone in your room."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3093
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_f92ce853:

    # "Bajas a sacar la camioneta del garaje unos minutos antes de lo acordado."
    "You go down to get the pickup truck out of the garage a few minutes earlier than agreed."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3095
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_bd1ed2d9:

    # "[eri] y [sca] ya te están esperando. Los nervios no han desaparecido del todo."
    "[eri] and [sca] are already waiting for you. The nerves haven't completely disappeared."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3097
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_f85205d9:

    # "Durante el trayecto [sca] hace mil preguntas a [eri]. Quiere saber cómo funciona todo antes de la entrevista."
    "During the trip, [sca] asks [eri] a thousand questions. She wants to know how everything works before the interview."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3099
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_3055ef57:

    # "Al llegar al café, [eri] sustituye a [eil], que se sienta a tomar un café con [sca] y contigo."
    "When you arrive at the café, [eri] replaces [eil], who sits down to have a coffee with [sca] and you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3100
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_a65a65bb:

    # "El bombardeo de preguntas se dirige a la pelirroja ahora."
    "The barrage of questions is now directed at the redhead."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3102
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_8d5eabbe:

    # "La llegada de [oma] salva tu salud mental. A la vigésima pregunta sobre la cafetera, tu cerebro se ha desconectado."
    "The arrival of [oma] saves your sanity. By the twentieth question about the coffee machine, your brain has shut down."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3103
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_c200dcae:

    # oma "¿Qué tal? ¿Ya ha tenido la entrevista?"
    oma "How's it going? Did she have the interview yet?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3104
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_2f9620ba:

    # mc "No, aún no. El jefe llegará en una hora más o menos."
    mc "No, not yet. The boss will be here in about an hour."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3105
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_043d7282:

    # oma "¿Te vas a quedar hasta que acabe la entrevista?"
    oma "Are you going to stay until the interview is over?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3106
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_43567b9e:

    # mc "Sí, entonces la llevaré a ella y a [eil] a casa. Quiero saber si le han dado el trabajo."
    mc "Yes, then I'll take her and [eil] home. I want to know if she got the job."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3108
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_8f0f2c6c:

    # eil "No lo sabrá hoy. Hay un par de chicas más que vienen a hacer entrevistas después de ella."
    eil "She won't know today. There are a couple more girls coming in for interviews after her."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3109
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_116e0b4a:

    # eil "Lo más probable es que mi jefe avise a la chica que contrate mañana."
    eil "My boss will most likely notify the girl he hires tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3110
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_eb12d7be:

    # mc "De todas formas esperaré para llevaros a casa."
    mc "Anyway, I'll wait to take you home."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3112
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_44cb32fb:

    # eil "No hace falta. Puedes llevar a [oma] y que ella me deje su coche y yo llevo a [sca]."
    eil "No need. You can take [oma] and she can lend me her car, and I'll take [sca]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3113
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_e36f2161:

    # eil "*Risa* De todas formas vamos a seguir ignorándote."
    eil "*Laugh* We're going to keep ignoring you anyway."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3114
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_a8c4b70f:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que puedo nombrar 17 partes de la cafetera ahora mismo. Y seis tipos de pastas que vendéis."
    mc "*Laugh* I think I can name 17 parts of the coffee machine right now. And six types of pastries that you sell."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3116
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_ccb885b8:

    # sca "Lo siento, [mc]. Sé que no soy una buena compañía cuando me pongo así. Quiero saber todo lo posible antes de la entrevista."
    sca "I'm sorry, [mc]. I know I'm not good company when I get like this. I want to know as much as possible before the interview."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3117
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_8b945464:

    # mc "No te preocupes, es lógico. Va a ser tu primer trabajo."
    mc "Don't worry, it makes sense. It's going to be your first job."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3118
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_cd4ee309:

    # sca "Si consigo el trabajo..."
    sca "If I get the job..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3119
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_d042c476:

    # mc "Cuando consigas el trabajo."
    mc "When you get the job."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3121
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_e7c8aee0:

    # oma "Entonces, ¿me llevas a casa?"
    oma "So, will you drive me home?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3122
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_8baab0ee:

    # mc "Sí, si estas dos van a seguir ignorándome no tiene ningún sentido que me quede. *Risa*"
    mc "Yes, if these two are going to keep ignoring me, there's no point in me staying. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3123
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_f298e3b6:

    # oma "Tengo que pasar por mi apartamento a coger los pijamas para dejarlos en casa."
    oma "I have to stop by my apartment to pick up my pajamas to leave them at home."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3124
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_0a1c3e79:

    # mc "¿También te vas a quedar a dormir hoy?"
    mc "Are you staying over tonight too?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3126
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_3444ddb5:

    # oma "No puedo. Empiezo mi turno a medianoche. Me iré después de cenar, pero así ya tendré los pijamas allí para el día que me pueda quedar."
    oma "I can't tonight. My shift starts at midnight. I'll leave after dinner, but that way I'll have my pajamas there for the day I can stay."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3128
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_c77fdd8c:

    # oma "*Risa* ¡[sai] no tiene pijamas! Y no estoy acostumbrada a dormir en camisón."
    oma "*Laugh* [sai] doesn't have any pajamas! And I'm not used to sleeping in a nightgown."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3130
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_dd92fb48:

    # mc "Pues te quedaba genial. Estabas super sexy."
    mc "Well, it looked great on you. You were super sexy."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3132
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_017f6902:

    # mc "Pues te quedaba muy bien."
    mc "Well, it looked great on you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3133
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_cbc8533a:

    # mc "Al menos te quedaba mejor de lo que le quedaba el pijama de [deb.nick] a [ama]."
    mc "At least it suited you better than [deb.nick]'s pajamas suited [ama]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3135
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_bfc67aac:

    # "Te despides de [sca], [eil] y [eri] y emprendes el camino al apartamento de [oma]."
    "You say goodbye to [sca], [eil], and [eri] and set off for [oma]'s apartment."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3136
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_2d46c0f1:

    # "Vive a dos calles y vais dando un paseo."
    "She lives two blocks away, so you take a walk."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3139
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_c5432ede:

    # "Se te hace raro pasear cogido de la mano con [oma]. Maravillosamente raro."
    "It feels strange to walk hand in hand with [oma]. Wonderfully strange."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3140
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_ab172596:

    # "No habéis hecho muchas cosas de las que hacen las parejas normales. Nunca habéis paseado ni salido a cenar."
    "You haven't done many of the things that normal couples do. You've never gone for a walk or out to dinner."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3141
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_9a395341:

    # "Pero no por ello estás menos loco por ella. La normalidad está sobrevalorada."
    "But that doesn't make you any less crazy about her. Normalcy is overrated."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3142
translate english c27s004_ScaInterview_6b0d3e09:

    # "Y vas a ver su apartamento por primera vez."
    "And you're going to see her apartment for the first time."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3158
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_b8c29d77:

    # "Mientras tanto, en el sótano..."
    "Meanwhile, in the basement..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3159
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_eb887920:

    # mom "Parece que hace años que pintamos la habitación de [sai]."
    mom "It seems like it has been years since we painted [sai]'s room."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3160
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_ae49dea8:

    # nor "Tienes razón. Aunque parezca mentira, no ha pasado un mes todavía de aquello."
    nor "You're right. Believe it or not, it hasn't even been a month since that happened."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3161
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_b4661f5d:

    # emm "Y aquel día estaba [mc] en vez de [kim]. Hoy no podremos humillarlo con una batalla de pintura."
    emm "And that day it was [mc] instead of [kim]. Today we won't be able to humiliate him with a paint battle."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3162
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_6f1acaa2:

    # kim "¿Hicisteis una batalla de pintura?"
    kim "Did you have a paint battle?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3164
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_41cfb172:

    # mom "Ya sabes cómo va esto. *Risa* [mc] dijo algo que no le gustó a [emm] y [emm] le pegó con el rodillo."
    mom "You know how it goes. *Laugh* [mc] said something [emm] didn't like, so [emm] hit him with the roller."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3165
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_49686b65:

    # mom "Acabamos haciendo una batalla [emm] y yo contra [nor] y [mc]."
    mom "We ended up having a battle, [emm] and me against [nor] and [mc]."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3167
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_0a696588:

    # kim "Me encanta cómo hacéis algo divertido de cualquier situación."
    kim "I love how you guys can make anything fun. Even painting."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3169
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_81cdea0f:

    # emm "No, [kim]. No es 'hacéis'. Ahora es 'hacemos'. Tienes que empezar a incluirte cuando hables de la familia."
    emm "No, [kim]. It's not 'you make'. Now it's 'we make'. You have to start including yourself when you talk about the family."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3170
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_f988f88e:

    # emm "Por cierto, la batalla la ganamos nosotras como es normal."
    emm "By the way, we won the battle, as expected."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3172
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_503ff04b:

    # nor "*Risa* No estoy demasiado segura de que eso sea verdad."
    nor "*Laugh* I'm not too sure that's true."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3174
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_a6cc3943:

    # emm "¡Por supuesto que ganamos nosotras!"
    emm "Of course we won!"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3176
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_33392f5a:

    # kim "¿A qué te refieres, [nor]?"
    kim "What do you mean, [nor]?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3179
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_fd412187:

    # nor "Perder aquella batalla de pintura fue el primer paso para que [mc] y yo acabáramos juntos."
    nor "Losing that paint battle was the first step toward [mc] and I ending up together."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3181
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_618fb198:

    # nor "Nos acabamos duchando juntos. Y no una ducha inocente como las que tomábamos cuando él era un niño."
    nor "We ended up showering together. And not an innocent shower like the ones we used to take when he was a child."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3183
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_3b59ea40:

    # emm "¿Qué? ¿Follasteis aquel día? ¿En la ducha?"
    emm "What? Did you have sex that day? In the shower?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3185
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_a2b1e979:

    # nor "*Risa* No, pero aún no sé cómo conseguimos parar a tiempo. Fue muy tórrido."
    nor "*Laugh* No, but I still don't know how we managed to not do it. It was so hot..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3187
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_939f40b9:

    # nor "Estuve a punto de meterme en la ducha con él."
    nor "I almost got into the shower with him."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3189
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_c28db764:

    # emm "¿Qué? ¿Follasteis aquel día? ¿En el baño?"
    emm "What? Did you have sex that day? In the shower?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3191
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_7fb497eb:

    # nor "*Risa* No, no me dejó entrar en la ducha, pero no sé qué hubiera pasado si me hubiera dejado."
    nor "*Laugh* No, he didn't let me in the shower, but I don't know what would have happened if he had."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3193
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_60baacae:

    # nor "Después de aquella batalla estaba buscando un sitio donde ducharme y quitarme la pintura. Encontré a [mc] en la ducha."
    nor "After that battle, I was looking for a place to shower and wash off the paint. I found [mc] in the shower."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3194
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_cfb00f0c:

    # nor "¿Os acordáis del pestillo roto en el baño? Creo que fui la primera en verlo desnudo desde que volvió a casa."
    nor "Do you remember the broken latch in the bathroom? I think I was the first to see him naked since he came home."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3196
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_b562ea2d:

    # emm "Nope. *Risita* Yo lo vi el día anterior, en la ducha del gimnasio."
    emm "Nope. *Giggle* I saw him the day before, in the gym shower."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3197
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_185bf539:

    # emm "Y [sca] y [dap] un poco más tarde, en la piscina, mientras hacíamos una batalla de caballos."
    emm "And [sca] and [dap] a little later, in the pool, while we were having the horse fight."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3199
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_2a6ffe0e:

    # emm "Y [eri] ese mismo día, pero más tarde, también en la ducha del pestillo roto."
    emm "And [eri] that same day, but later, also in the shower with the broken latch."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3200
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_3c88db8d:

    # emm "*Risa* Con lo que, como mínimo, fuiste la quinta, Tía [nor], dependiendo de si mi madre lo vio antes que tú."
    emm "*Laugh* So, at the very least, you were the fifth, Aunt [nor], depending on whether my mother saw him before you did."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3202
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_c67edef3:

    # mom "*Risa* Yo el día de la batalla de pintura, pero por la noche."
    mom "*Laugh* I saw him the day of the paint battle, but at night."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3203
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_18bd1ac0:

    # mom "Todas lo visteis desnudo antes que yo."
    mom "You all saw him naked before I did."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3205
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_4d0d3242:

    # kim "*Risa* Parece uno de esos juegos a los que juega [deb.nick]."
    kim "*Laugh* It looks like one of those games that [deb.nick] plays."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3207
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_e5faa4e4:

    # nor "La verdad es que pasaron cosas realmente extrañas en aquellos días después de la llegada de [mc]."
    nor "The truth is that some really strange things happened in those days after [mc] arrived."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3208
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_ec19456d:

    # nor "La paliza que recibió de Jack, el ex-novio de [eri]... Aunque después se la devolviera..."
    nor "The beating he received from Jack, [eri]'s ex-boyfriend... Even though he got his revenge later..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3210
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_a7bbd184:

    # mom "La fiesta de disfraces..."
    mom "The costume party..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3212
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_c949951d:

    # emm "El juego de verdad o reto..."
    emm "The truth or dare game..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3214
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_221b8344:

    # kim "Y después pasó lo más raro. *Risa* Llegamos nosotras."
    kim "And then the strangest thing happened. *Laugh* We arrived."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3216
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_b3b94564:

    # todas "*Risa*"
    todas "*Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3217
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_956292ce:

    # mom "Bueno, lo realmente raro fue la llegada de [sai]. *Risa* Nadie la esperaba."
    mom "Well, the really strange thing was [sai]'s arrival. *Laugh* No one was expecting her."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3218
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_8b5d3123:

    # nor "*Risa* Bueno, todos la esperábamos, pero no esperábamos que fuera la novia de [mc] en Portland."
    nor "*Laugh* Well, we were all expecting her, but we didn't expect her to be [mc]'s girlfriend from Portland."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3220
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_23677926:

    # emm "Bueno, no era la novia exactamente, ¿no?"
    emm "Well, she wasn't exactly his girlfriend, was she?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3221
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_3e96ff03:

    # emm "Tenían una relación abierta y todo eso."
    emm "They had an open relationship and all that."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3223
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_0bb922b6:

    # kim "A ver qué sorpresas nos deparan las chicas nuevas. Tengo ganas de conocerlas."
    kim "Let's see what surprises the new girls have in store for us. I'm looking forward to meeting them."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3224
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_6a212ef5:

    # kim "Y también tengo ganas de saber si se integrarán en la familia igual que nosotras."
    kim "And I also want to know if they will want to become part of the family just like us."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3226
