    mom "I know which email [nor]'s talking about. More than weird, it's something I would never have thought of."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3233
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_fafda3c4:

    # nor "Ya lo tengo. Os lo leo."
    nor "I found it. I'll read it to you."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3234
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_1a24ae6c:

    # nor "Querida Señora Marks,"
    nor "Dear Mrs. Marks,"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3235
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_51d96265:

    # nor "Soy [kal], una de las estudiantes que se van a alojar en su casa a partir del mes que viene."
    nor "I am [kal], one of the students who will be staying at your house starting next month."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3236
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_533665d4:

    # nor "Es mi primera experiencia viviendo en el extranjero y con chicas de otras culturas."
    nor "It is my first experience living abroad and with girls from other cultures."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3237
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_776c3ca5:

    # nor "La universidad me ha informado de que todas las chicas somos de primer año, con lo que es posible que a ellas les pase lo mismo."
    nor "The university has informed me that all the girls are first-year students, so it is possible that the same thing is happening to them."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3239
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_cf5f2e87:

    # nor "No lo de diferentes culturas, claro, ya que ellas, por lo que tengo entendido son americanas."
    nor "Not the different cultures thing, of course, since, as far as I know, they are American."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3240
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_e1317dcc:

    # nor "Para empezar a conocernos, ya que vamos a compartir habitaciones durante al menos un año, me gustaría proponerle una idea."
    nor "To get to know each other, since we will be sharing rooms for at least a year, I would like to suggest an idea."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3241
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_23e4f570:

    # nor "Si fuera posible, nos podríamos hacer una foto cada una, y así sabríamos qué aspecto tenemos."
    nor "If possible, we could each take a photo, so we would know what we look like."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3242
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_5db14712:

    # nor "Para hacerlo más divertido, me gustaría proponer que fuera el mismo día a la misma hora, si fuera posible."
    nor "To make it more fun, I would like to suggest that it be on the same day at the same time, if possible."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3243
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_c653ea79:

    # nor "Así sería como si estuviéramos juntas por primera vez, aunque nos separen muchos kilómetros de distancia."
    nor "That way, it would be as if we were together for the first time, even though we are separated by many kilometers."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3245
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_af1884bc:

    # nor "He estado pensando en las diferencias horarias, y creo que hacerlo a las 19:00 GMT del 4 de agosto estaría bien."
    nor "I've been thinking about the time differences, and I think doing it at 19:00 GMT on 4 August would be fine."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3246
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_7f844e8d:

    # nor "De esa forma, en Estados Unidos serían entre las 11:00 y las 14:00, y las chicas no tendrían que madrugar demasiado."
    nor "That way, in the United States it would be between 11:00 and 14:00, and the girls would not have to get up too early."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3247
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_6f1ccc27:

    # nor "Si le parece bien, por favor, reenvíe este correo a las chicas con las que compartiré casa."
    nor "If that's alright with you, please forward this email to the girls I'll be sharing your house with."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3248
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_64b67f90:

    # nor "Se lo enviaría yo, pero la Universidad no ha querido darme sus correos electrónicos."
    nor "I would send it to them, but the University has refused to give me their email addresses."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3249
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_2b5dedf8:

    # nor "Después, cada una de las que acepten hacerse la foto podemos enviárselas a usted para que nos las reenvíe al resto."
    nor "Afterwards, each of those who agree to take the photo can send it to you, and you can forward it to the rest of us."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3251
translate english c27s005_PaintBasement_c80e7c9d:

    # nor "Estoy muy emocionada por conocerla a usted y a su familia. Mi prima me ha contado cosas alucinantes."
