translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_62a6b4a3:

    # oma "Ven a mi habitación, te la enseño antes de coger los pijamas."
    oma "Come to my room, I'll show it to you before I get my pajamas."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3373
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_ddbb2b57:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Has hecho la cama?"
    mc "*Laugh* Did you make your bed?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3374
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_0d321078:

    # oma "No dormí aquí anoche, con lo que no era necesario. Pero la hago siempre que me levanto."
    oma "I didn't sleep here last night, so it wasn't needed. But I always do it when I get up."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3376
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_c9d0cc38:

    # oma "Pues esta es mi habitación. No es gran cosa pero suficiente para mí."
    oma "Well, this is my room. It's not much, but it's enough for me."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3377
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_3ca2575e:

    # oma "Al otro lado de esa pared está la habitación de invitados y detrás de ésta, el baño que también sirve de sala de la colada."
    oma "On the other side of that wall is the guest room, and behind this one, the bathroom, which also serves as a laundry room."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3378
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_9105bad6:

    # mc "Me gustan los cuadros."
    mc "I like those paintings."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3380
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_6697c725:

    # mc "Y ese póster de reclutamiento."
    mc "And that recruitment poster."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3381
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_cc3253ed:

    # oma "*Risa* A ti lo que te gusta es la chica."
    oma "*Laugh* What you like is the girl."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3382
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_6835d88e:

    # mc "Es mona."
    mc "She's cute."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3384
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_57b8be37:

    # oma "Es el poster de reclutamiento que veía por todos lados cuando era adolescente."
    oma "It's the recruitment poster I saw everywhere when I was a teenager."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3385
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_a6e51f62:

    # oma "Ver a una Latina tan mona con el uniforme me ayudó a cambiar mi idea sobre ser abogada. No es que me compare con ella, claro."
    oma "Seeing such a cute Latina in uniform helped me change my mind about being a lawyer. Not that I compare myself to her, of course."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3387
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_45f56c03:

    # oma "Cuando vino a mi instituto a una de esas charlas que da la policía de vez en cuando, la idea ya estaba en mi cabeza y le pedí uno de los posters."
    oma "When she came to my school for one of those talks that the police give from time to time, the idea was already in my head, and I asked her for one of the posters."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3388
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_169c5cf5:

    # oma "Su charla y las explicaciones que dio sobre cómo podía ayudar al vecindario me acabó de convencer."
    oma "Her talk and explanations about how she could help the neighborhood finally won me over."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3389
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_975f8d96:

    # mc "Siempre pensé que la gente de esos carteles eran modelos."
    mc "I always thought the people on those posters were models."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3391
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_5b93f3fa:

    # oma "No en el caso de Esperanza. Ella es... o era... una patrullera, pero la escogieron para la campaña de reclutamiento y de relaciones públicas."
    oma "Not in Esperanza's case. She is... or was... a patrol officer, but she was chosen for the recruitment and public relations campaign."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3392
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_50086073:

    # mc "¿Has dicho 'era'...?"
    mc "You said 'she was'...?"

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3394
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_63f4c0a2:

    # oma "¡Oh, no! No me refiero a que haya muerto. *Risa* Me refería a que hace años de eso y a lo mejor ya es detective o sargento."
    oma "Oh, no! I didn't mean that she died. *Laugh* I meant that it's been years since then, and maybe she's a detective or sergeant now."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3395
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_0f7784d4:

    # mc "*Risa triste* Menos mal. Por un momento había pensado que..."
    mc "*Relieved laugh* Thank goodness. For a moment there, I thought that..."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3397
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_01a7133e:

    # oma "Lo entiendo. Cada vez que sale alguna noticia de un policía que ha muerto en acto de servicio en cualquier parte del país mi madre me llama."
    oma "I understand. Every time there is a news story about a police officer who has died in the line of duty anywhere in the country, my mother calls me."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3398
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_d6fea21b:

    # oma "Hablamos todas las semanas por teléfono, pero cuando ve algo así en las noticias hace una video conferencia."
    oma "We talk on the phone every week, but when she watches something like that on the news, she sets up a video conference."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3399
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_fe7a2701:

    # mc "Quiere asegurarse de que estés bien. Y quiere verlo con sus propios ojos."
    mc "She wants to make sure you're okay. And she wants to see it with her own eyes."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3401
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_bbc76ed2:

    # oma "Es exactamente eso, aunque ella no se dé cuenta. Da lo mismo si hemos hablado hoy. Si mañana muere un agente en Florida, mi madre hará una video llamada."
    oma "That's exactly what it is, even if she doesn't realize it. It doesn't matter if we talked today. If an officer dies in New Hampshire tomorrow, my mother will make a video call."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3402
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_fc49d380:

    # mc "Es normal. Yo también lo haría. Es más, yo haría video conferencias en cada llamada."
    mc "That's natural. I would do the same. In fact, I would use video conferencing for every call."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3403
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_dc521bb9:

    # mc "Creo que me voy a pasar el día pegado a la cámara cuando esté en Aruba."
    mc "I think I'm going to spend the day glued to my webcam when I'm in Aruba."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3405
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_4b1692cc:

    # oma "Te vamos a echar mucho de menos."
    oma "We're going to miss you very much."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3406
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_3c28c0bd:

    # mc "Y yo a vosotras. Va a ser raro estar tanto tiempo separados."
    mc "And I'll miss you too. It's going to be strange being apart for so long."

# game/scripts/c27/c27.rpy:3409
translate english c27s006_OmaHouse_26c2ab2a:

    # oma "Por suerte, aún quedan días para que te vayas."
    oma "Luckily, there are still a few days left before you leave."

